WEBVTT

00:00:00.670 --> 00:00:01.500
'Come in, dear.'

00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:03.500
'Sir, you carry on. I have to..'

00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:05.930
'Oh, come on.
Let's have a cup of coffee.'

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:09.050
'Reena, I need to talk
to you in private.'

00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:11.690
'I can't be the way I used to be.'

00:00:11.960 --> 00:00:12.960
'I've moved on.'

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:14.780
'You must move on too.'

00:00:34.580 --> 00:00:37.500
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

00:00:39.610 --> 00:00:42.250
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:47.830
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:51.780
♪ Our patience wins ♪

00:00:52.120 --> 00:00:54.430
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

00:00:54.760 --> 00:00:57.280
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

00:00:57.470 --> 00:01:00.030
♪ I am a doctor ♪

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:04.950
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:09.950
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:16.020
♪ In it, I'm a doctor ♪

00:01:34.330 --> 00:01:35.310
Hi, Doctor.

00:01:36.750 --> 00:01:39.450
Arjun, how are you feeling now?
Does it hurt anywhere?

00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:40.960
My hands are fine, sir.

00:01:41.670 --> 00:01:43.290
But my legs and head are hurting.

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:46.940
Okay, I'll check
and recommend some painkillers.

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:47.890
Yes, sir.

00:01:48.160 --> 00:01:49.640
Fortunately, you've
suffered minor injuries

00:01:49.690 --> 00:01:51.100
despite the speed
you were driving at.

00:01:51.210 --> 00:01:54.170
When you're drunk,
you shouldn't drive, Arjun.

00:01:54.330 --> 00:01:55.830
You have to be careful, man.

00:01:56.440 --> 00:01:58.810
No, sir. Usually, I don't
drive when I'm drunk.

00:01:59.290 --> 00:02:00.750
I'd ask the driver
to come pick me up.

00:02:01.670 --> 00:02:03.810
But he wasn't available yesterday
due to some work.

00:02:05.340 --> 00:02:08.840
That's why, I decided to drive
because my house was nearby.

00:02:09.920 --> 00:02:10.820
My mistake.

00:02:11.270 --> 00:02:13.400
You should book a cab
if you don't have a driver.

00:02:13.620 --> 00:02:14.700
Shouldn't you be safe?

00:02:15.370 --> 00:02:16.220
You're right, sir.

00:02:16.670 --> 00:02:18.280
Give it to me.
- Sir, scan reports.

00:02:23.080 --> 00:02:24.880
Sir. Sir..

00:02:25.450 --> 00:02:26.780
My boss is fine, right?

00:02:26.880 --> 00:02:30.310
Your boss is fine.
He just has some minor injuries.

00:02:30.420 --> 00:02:32.840
He'll start walking in two days.
Don't worry.

00:02:34.250 --> 00:02:35.080
Arjun.

00:02:36.170 --> 00:02:37.450
You have to be careful, man.

00:02:38.290 --> 00:02:40.940
Whatever it is,
don't hesitate to call me anytime.

00:02:40.980 --> 00:02:42.700
Just disturb me,
alright? No problem.

00:02:43.670 --> 00:02:44.500
Thank you, sir.

00:02:45.080 --> 00:02:46.460
Why are you thanking me?

00:02:46.750 --> 00:02:48.950
Reena is the one
who helped you all night.

00:02:50.170 --> 00:02:52.390
First aid and treatment,
she's only done it.

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:56.210
The other interns, Guna and
Anitha.. they were completely drunk.

00:02:56.710 --> 00:02:59.400
So if you want to thank anyone,
please thank Reena.

00:03:05.750 --> 00:03:07.720
Arjun, take care of yourself.

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:09.360
I don't want you
to repeat this, alright?

00:03:09.920 --> 00:03:11.530
And.. Reena.
- Sir?

00:03:11.830 --> 00:03:13.970
Once Naveen comes,
hand over Arjun's case to him

00:03:14.040 --> 00:03:15.530
and you can relieve yourself.
- Okay, sir.

00:03:16.460 --> 00:03:19.160
Arjun. I want to see you
running in two days, alright?

00:03:20.180 --> 00:03:21.920
Sure, sir.
- Thank you, Doctor.

00:03:36.710 --> 00:03:37.540
Reena.

00:03:43.680 --> 00:03:44.520
Thank you.

00:03:47.330 --> 00:03:49.450
I would've done this
to anyone in your place.

00:03:49.670 --> 00:03:50.890
I just did my job.

00:03:57.710 --> 00:03:59.710
Hey, Reena.
Is Arjun alive?

00:04:02.380 --> 00:04:03.530
How is Arjun?

00:04:04.580 --> 00:04:05.690
Why don't you go and see him?

00:04:06.340 --> 00:04:08.990
You're coming from there.
That's why I asked you.

00:04:09.420 --> 00:04:12.080
He has a head injury. Two or three
scratches on his hand. Right ankle sprain.

00:04:12.250 --> 00:04:14.030
No major injuries.
Is that enough?

00:04:14.540 --> 00:04:18.160
So.. Your plan to kill
Arjun has flopped, I guess.

00:04:19.080 --> 00:04:20.630
Do you want
to get beaten up, Rocky?

00:04:21.080 --> 00:04:24.670
No. You two were talking
on the balcony last night.

00:04:25.380 --> 00:04:26.290
That's why I asked.

00:04:28.170 --> 00:04:30.290
So what's going on between you two?

00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:32.410
I told him everything
clearly yesterday.

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:33.420
What did you tell him?

00:04:33.650 --> 00:04:37.200
I told him our relationship is over.
I've moved on and he should too.

00:04:37.580 --> 00:04:39.730
Reena, why are you
saying it so casually?

00:04:40.460 --> 00:04:44.310
I think Arjun kept
thinking about what you said

00:04:44.750 --> 00:04:45.980
and met with an accident.

00:04:46.210 --> 00:04:49.290
I don't think so. Shut up.
Don't say this to anyone.

00:04:49.790 --> 00:04:51.170
Don't be silly, Reena.

00:04:51.500 --> 00:04:54.490
Do you think no one would've
saved Arjun if not for you?

00:04:54.790 --> 00:04:58.500
You're guilty. That's why you did
everything without informing anyone.

00:05:00.710 --> 00:05:01.900
Hi, Reena.

00:05:06.290 --> 00:05:08.860
Why is he coming here daily
like a loan shark?

00:05:08.960 --> 00:05:10.450
Do you think he knows the truth?

00:05:11.100 --> 00:05:12.960
I don't know.
Let me check.

00:05:15.110 --> 00:05:17.400
Good morning, sir.
How come you're here so early?

00:05:17.490 --> 00:05:20.520
I think my blood sugar is low.

00:05:20.570 --> 00:05:22.570
So I came here to get it
checked by Reena.

00:05:23.030 --> 00:05:25.370
He wants it done by you.
So he doesn't know the truth yet.

00:05:25.420 --> 00:05:28.880
Sir, Reena will do the check-up.
I have some work. - Okay.

00:05:29.420 --> 00:05:30.860
Give him all the pills.
- Come on.

00:05:30.920 --> 00:05:31.760
Let's go, sir.

00:05:42.460 --> 00:05:43.780
Sir, you don't have any problem.

00:05:44.120 --> 00:05:47.850
The medicines you're taking now are
too strong for your body condition.

00:05:48.040 --> 00:05:52.250
So, I'm reducing the dosage.
You can follow that.

00:05:55.790 --> 00:05:57.630
Get this and come back.
- Okay, Doctor.

00:06:00.290 --> 00:06:02.770
Sir, the nurse will get you
the pills for 10 days.

00:06:02.830 --> 00:06:04.470
Wait right here.
You don't have to worry.

00:06:12.790 --> 00:06:13.710
What happened, sir?

00:06:14.170 --> 00:06:15.600
Why are you looking
at me like that?

00:06:16.830 --> 00:06:20.580
When I look at you,
I'm reminded of my daughter, Radhi.

00:06:21.460 --> 00:06:22.540
She's also like this.

00:06:22.630 --> 00:06:26.700
She loves her work as a doctor.

00:06:30.460 --> 00:06:34.630
So I don't know why she
has resigned from her job as a doctor.

00:06:36.080 --> 00:06:37.130
I don't understand.

00:06:37.810 --> 00:06:42.450
She used to spend more time
in the hospital than at home.

00:06:42.670 --> 00:06:44.960
She wouldn't even attend
any kind of family events.

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:47.120
Just two months
after Sid was born..

00:06:47.430 --> 00:06:49.630
She came back to work
in the second month.

00:06:52.560 --> 00:06:55.370
She loves her job.

00:06:55.500 --> 00:06:59.840
No matter who it is, no matter
how much they love their job,

00:07:00.330 --> 00:07:04.120
at some point,
they'll stop liking their job.

00:07:04.960 --> 00:07:06.460
But Radhi is not like that.

00:07:07.250 --> 00:07:10.560
She's always dedicated to her job.

00:07:11.330 --> 00:07:12.810
She loved her job.

00:07:14.540 --> 00:07:18.600
She wanted to be a doctor
since childhood.

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:21.120
Even though she had a lot
of problems at a young age,

00:07:21.370 --> 00:07:25.220
she studied hard
and became a doctor.

00:07:25.540 --> 00:07:26.380
Yes.

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:29.750
Sir, what kind of a problem was it?

00:07:32.790 --> 00:07:36.040
A problem that no girl
should face at a young age.

00:07:36.830 --> 00:07:38.160
But Radhi faced it.

00:07:38.420 --> 00:07:44.460
But she overcame everything
and became a doctor.

00:07:45.880 --> 00:07:47.920
Now she has a problem.

00:07:48.120 --> 00:07:50.180
And I don't know what it is.

00:07:53.960 --> 00:07:56.410
Why didn't you ask her about it?

00:07:57.540 --> 00:07:58.460
I told you.

00:07:59.460 --> 00:08:01.890
Radhi and I have some misgivings.

00:08:02.120 --> 00:08:04.420
She doesn't talk to me.

00:08:05.210 --> 00:08:08.340
I still asked her.
But she wouldn't tell me anything.

00:08:09.460 --> 00:08:10.890
Why doesn't she talk to you?

00:08:11.790 --> 00:08:13.350
Radhi..
- Doctor!

00:08:13.750 --> 00:08:16.140
Dr. Preetham called you.
He asked you to come urgently.

00:08:21.920 --> 00:08:23.510
Sorry, sir.
I have to go now.

00:08:23.790 --> 00:08:26.490
It's okay.
Work is important.

00:08:26.710 --> 00:08:28.440
We'll talk later, okay?

00:08:28.830 --> 00:08:32.780
Reena, Radhi shouldn't
know that I came here.

00:08:33.500 --> 00:08:34.920
It's better if you don't tell her.

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:41.860
Nurse, give me a pen.

00:08:42.460 --> 00:08:44.160
Hi, senior.
- Hi.

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:46.840
How is your urgent work?

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:50.300
They don't have any major injuries.
It's okay.

00:08:53.500 --> 00:08:55.490
Did you see Reena?
- No.

00:08:57.170 --> 00:09:00.250
She hasn't been
talking to me recently.

00:09:01.750 --> 00:09:03.270
Really? Why?

00:09:03.880 --> 00:09:07.430
Dr. Preetham has asked her
to handle a case directly.

00:09:08.210 --> 00:09:10.660
Since then,
her attitude has changed.

00:09:11.500 --> 00:09:13.840
She didn't talk to me
even at the party.

00:09:14.000 --> 00:09:16.400
Senior, I think you are wrong.

00:09:16.750 --> 00:09:17.970
Reena wouldn't do that.

00:09:18.960 --> 00:09:22.420
I am not stupid enough to not know
how someone behaves with me.

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:26.240
She wants to handle this case
alone, as her case.

00:09:27.080 --> 00:09:30.980
But she doesn't know
that it's not that easy.

00:09:32.850 --> 00:09:36.280
Senior, things don't always go
the way you want them to.

00:09:37.250 --> 00:09:38.850
Sometimes
such situations do happen.

00:09:39.420 --> 00:09:41.110
It depends on how we handle it.

00:09:41.710 --> 00:09:44.090
Don't worry
unnecessarily about Reena.

00:09:44.250 --> 00:09:46.660
She can handle it.
- I knew it.

00:09:47.170 --> 00:09:49.610
You support everyone except me.

00:09:49.920 --> 00:09:51.040
Why did I even tell you?

00:09:57.170 --> 00:09:58.030
Sir.

00:09:59.120 --> 00:10:01.540
Patient Ganga's test reports
and my evaluation.

00:10:03.830 --> 00:10:05.670
Keep it aside.
Tell me your findings.

00:10:06.230 --> 00:10:09.100
Patient Ganga was operated
with three stents six months ago.

00:10:09.270 --> 00:10:11.710
It was a triple vessel disease.
This is the history.

00:10:11.950 --> 00:10:14.050
She was admitted with chest pain.

00:10:14.290 --> 00:10:16.660
We've diagnosed her
with pulmonary oedema.

00:10:17.220 --> 00:10:18.820
I know that.
Come to the point.

00:10:19.460 --> 00:10:22.130
Sir, there are ECG test reports.

00:10:22.290 --> 00:10:24.770
She had MI but it's mild.

00:10:25.330 --> 00:10:29.920
There is a small spike. We tested
for drop INT and it's positive.

00:10:30.680 --> 00:10:34.470
We took the patient to cath lab
and we did angio to avoid delays.

00:10:35.500 --> 00:10:38.010
But unfortunately..

00:10:38.580 --> 00:10:40.770
Thrombus is already formed
in her stents.

00:10:41.710 --> 00:10:44.910
So..
- Bypass surgery.

00:10:46.460 --> 00:10:48.890
But what about the complications?
- Yes.

00:10:49.380 --> 00:10:51.700
It's difficult to remove her
from the ventilator.

00:10:52.250 --> 00:10:55.860
She may wake up early. Or she
may take a day or even a week.

00:10:56.120 --> 00:10:58.560
There is a possibility
of infection spreading.

00:10:58.670 --> 00:11:01.180
Also, death is a possibility.

00:11:02.830 --> 00:11:04.920
Right, but it's normal
in such cases.

00:11:05.640 --> 00:11:09.550
Yes, sir. But..
There is another problem.

00:11:09.830 --> 00:11:11.960
What is it?
- Mr. Rajendran.

00:11:12.160 --> 00:11:13.830
He said that he will
allow the surgery

00:11:13.880 --> 00:11:15.550
to proceed only if
Dr. Radhi is here.

00:11:16.290 --> 00:11:18.330
I tried talking to him.

00:11:18.710 --> 00:11:21.420
He is adamant on Dr. Radhi
doing the surgery.

00:11:21.670 --> 00:11:25.200
I can't talk to him anymore.
- Okay. I'll talk to Arjun.

00:11:25.330 --> 00:11:26.250
We'll figure out something.

00:11:26.690 --> 00:11:27.790
Carry on.
- Sure, sir.

00:11:28.710 --> 00:11:29.560
Reena.

00:11:30.750 --> 00:11:34.270
You, the interns and Guna.
Come to the conference room.

00:11:34.420 --> 00:11:36.210
I need to discuss another
case with you. - Sure, sir.

00:11:36.250 --> 00:11:37.150
I'll inform them.

00:11:43.380 --> 00:11:46.220
Wait for two minutes. The doctor
will be here. - Okay, Doctor.

00:11:46.420 --> 00:11:47.680
Are you a nurse?

00:11:48.250 --> 00:11:49.200
Nurse?

00:11:49.760 --> 00:11:51.510
Hey, shut up.
- I am also a doctor.

00:11:52.120 --> 00:11:54.820
He is a senior doctor.
- Oh.

00:11:58.040 --> 00:11:59.730
Hey!
- Sorry bro.

00:11:59.830 --> 00:12:01.430
Sorry. Does it hurt?

00:12:01.830 --> 00:12:03.030
Yes.
- Why would he do that?

00:12:04.040 --> 00:12:06.570
The wounds are severe.
How many people hit you?

00:12:06.880 --> 00:12:07.960
Only one.
- One.

00:12:08.830 --> 00:12:09.770
Only one?

00:12:10.830 --> 00:12:11.690
Who is he?

00:12:12.250 --> 00:12:13.760
Do you think
he gave me his ID card?

00:12:15.920 --> 00:12:18.110
So you'd let anyone hit you?

00:12:18.160 --> 00:12:20.640
Yes, we like that.
- He deserved that.

00:12:22.170 --> 00:12:23.830
Good morning, sir.
- Good morning.

00:12:26.040 --> 00:12:27.780
Who are they?
- Patients, sir.

00:12:30.750 --> 00:12:33.330
You look like Kamal Haasan
in the movie, 'Kuruthipunal'.

00:12:33.580 --> 00:12:36.050
He has started.
- I think you are badly hurt.

00:12:36.100 --> 00:12:37.120
Yes, Doctor.

00:12:37.170 --> 00:12:38.790
I will touch. Tell me if it hurts.
- Okay, Doctor.

00:12:39.290 --> 00:12:40.670
Here..
- It hurts, Doctor!

00:12:40.710 --> 00:12:44.490
Don't shout, don't shout. Rocky,
who are they? When did they come?

00:12:44.620 --> 00:12:45.750
Did anyone see Reena?

00:12:46.000 --> 00:12:49.200
No.
- Doctor, he is the one who hit me!

00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:51.270
You?
- I won't leave you alone!

00:12:59.790 --> 00:13:01.440
Let go!
- I want to hit him!

00:13:02.770 --> 00:13:03.840
Bring it on!

00:13:27.190 --> 00:13:28.500
Let me hit him once.

00:13:30.170 --> 00:13:30.970
Hey!

00:13:31.540 --> 00:13:33.570
Nilofer! Hey, Nilofer!

00:13:38.590 --> 00:13:39.660
Doctor..

00:13:47.040 --> 00:13:48.740
Stop struggling, please!

00:13:50.960 --> 00:13:51.820
Hey!

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:01.920
Pal, he killed the doctor.

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:03.580
Oh, no..
- Is he dead?

00:14:05.920 --> 00:14:06.860
What is this, Doctor?

00:14:07.880 --> 00:14:09.050
He hit your senior doctor.

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:13.740
Shut up, I'll handle it.

00:14:14.460 --> 00:14:16.560
Why didn't you come
to the party yesterday?

00:14:17.210 --> 00:14:18.900
I was tired, so I went to sleep.

00:14:19.200 --> 00:14:21.660
Come on, don't lie.

00:14:22.210 --> 00:14:24.860
We didn't invite Teju to the party.
That's why you are angry.

00:14:24.960 --> 00:14:27.620
So you didn't come.
- Nothing like that.

00:14:30.500 --> 00:14:33.490
We need to go to the police station
and get the bike.

00:14:33.960 --> 00:14:34.940
But he has called us here.

00:14:35.540 --> 00:14:36.560
When will we get my bike?

00:14:37.380 --> 00:14:39.420
My bike is stuck there
because of you.

00:14:40.330 --> 00:14:41.890
What a wonderful bike!

00:14:43.960 --> 00:14:45.110
Okay, okay, cool.

00:14:45.330 --> 00:14:48.420
Okay, guys, everyone settle down.
Come on, come on, everyone. Come.

00:14:48.940 --> 00:14:50.490
Okay, guys,
this is important, alright?

00:14:51.360 --> 00:14:53.500
We have a new patient
in our hospital.

00:14:53.710 --> 00:14:56.170
His name is Rauthar.
Heart patient and also diabetic.

00:14:56.580 --> 00:14:57.750
But he didn't come here for that.

00:14:57.960 --> 00:14:59.560
He has got severe back pain.

00:14:59.790 --> 00:15:02.260
And the pain radiates
in the left leg.

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:04.750
So I have asked him to get an MRI.

00:15:06.100 --> 00:15:07.240
His case file.

00:15:08.210 --> 00:15:10.850
The MRI report shows that
there is a disc bulge in his spine.

00:15:11.120 --> 00:15:13.840
Sir, can I see his scan reports?

00:15:14.920 --> 00:15:16.090
That's what I am trying to say.

00:15:16.540 --> 00:15:18.580
I am going to divide you all
into two teams, okay?

00:15:18.790 --> 00:15:21.140
I need a treatment plan
with your team members.

00:15:21.250 --> 00:15:22.400
Come up with it, alright?

00:15:22.540 --> 00:15:26.090
Whichever plan is better, you are
going to join me in the surgery.

00:15:27.670 --> 00:15:28.820
Reena.
- Yes, sir?

00:15:29.000 --> 00:15:30.830
You join with Nilofer and Kiran.

00:15:31.420 --> 00:15:32.980
Okay, sir.
- And Guna.

00:15:33.790 --> 00:15:35.460
Naveen and Kamal.
- Yes, sir.

00:15:37.080 --> 00:15:38.480
Excuse me, sir.

00:15:39.120 --> 00:15:40.660
I think you forgot me.

00:15:41.440 --> 00:15:43.830
How can I forget you, dear?
- Love you, sir.

00:15:43.880 --> 00:15:45.190
I left out your name on purpose.

00:15:48.080 --> 00:15:50.470
He doesn't want me to be involved
in such silly cases

00:15:50.540 --> 00:15:52.930
given my knowledge.
Am I right, sir?

00:15:53.170 --> 00:15:54.620
Are you so intelligent?

00:15:55.540 --> 00:15:57.170
Then let us put
your knowledge to test.

00:15:57.790 --> 00:16:00.040
Nilofer. You join with him.
- Yes, sir? Okay, sir.

00:16:00.110 --> 00:16:01.680
Two of them can work independently.
- With her?

00:16:01.920 --> 00:16:04.030
Sir, she won't even let me talk.

00:16:04.200 --> 00:16:07.690
Hey, guys. Jokes apart, this is
serious. Read the case properly.

00:16:07.950 --> 00:16:11.430
I've told you that it's a serious
case. You know his condition.

00:16:11.580 --> 00:16:12.770
Keep that in mind.

00:16:12.960 --> 00:16:15.320
The sooner you come up
with a plan, the better.

00:16:15.620 --> 00:16:16.730
Alright?
- Yes, sir.

00:16:16.850 --> 00:16:17.740
Any questions?

00:16:18.330 --> 00:16:19.600
This is a great opportunity.

00:16:20.170 --> 00:16:21.350
Use it well.

00:16:21.570 --> 00:16:23.220
Show me your full potential.

00:16:23.440 --> 00:16:25.150
Alright? All the best, guys.

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:28.540
Get to work. No time to waste.
Start working, go, go. - Okay, sir.

00:16:28.710 --> 00:16:29.550
Come on, Rocky.

00:16:32.290 --> 00:16:34.480
Doctor.
- Do we have any patients?

00:16:34.580 --> 00:16:36.640
No, Doctor.
You've attended to them all.

00:16:36.690 --> 00:16:38.750
The only in-patient
was also discharged.

00:16:40.880 --> 00:16:44.410
Okay then, get the logs for today.

00:16:44.460 --> 00:16:46.240
Let's check the accounts and leave.
- Okay, Doctor.

00:16:46.600 --> 00:16:48.740
And one minute!
I'll drop you today.

00:16:49.250 --> 00:16:50.270
Okay, Doctor.

00:17:19.150 --> 00:17:21.410
Oh God.. I can't..

00:17:21.540 --> 00:17:23.830
Who are you?
Why are you locking the door?

00:17:25.000 --> 00:17:26.180
My wife is going into labour.

00:17:27.250 --> 00:17:28.730
Please help her, Doctor.

00:17:29.620 --> 00:17:32.490
Oh, no, sir. We don't have enough
facilities for delivering a baby.

00:17:32.710 --> 00:17:34.160
Take her to another hospital.

00:17:34.250 --> 00:17:36.200
Please, Doctor.

00:17:36.380 --> 00:17:37.810
Do something.
Please save her.

00:17:37.960 --> 00:17:41.840
Didn't you hear what she said?
Why did you bring her here?

00:17:41.960 --> 00:17:43.680
Please be patient.
- Dear..

00:17:44.670 --> 00:17:46.800
Sir, shall I call an ambulance?
- Oh, God..

00:17:47.540 --> 00:17:49.000
They will take you.

00:17:49.170 --> 00:17:50.170
No need, Doctor.

00:17:50.830 --> 00:17:52.620
Please save her.

00:17:52.670 --> 00:17:54.980
It will get complicated
if you delay further.

00:17:55.050 --> 00:17:56.390
You won't understand.
Give me the phone.

00:17:57.460 --> 00:17:59.400
Hey! What are you doing?

00:17:59.460 --> 00:18:00.360
What are you doing?

00:18:00.670 --> 00:18:02.140
Nurse, call the police.

00:18:03.880 --> 00:18:04.860
Give me the phone.

00:18:06.920 --> 00:18:08.110
Give me the phone.

00:18:08.960 --> 00:18:09.890
Give it to him.

00:18:13.120 --> 00:18:14.540
I can't go out.

00:18:15.670 --> 00:18:17.180
The police will arrest me.

00:18:18.250 --> 00:18:19.470
I was patient, right?

00:18:20.750 --> 00:18:22.250
Why did you make me take the knife?

00:18:23.870 --> 00:18:25.600
Please help me.

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:29.390
Please save my wife.

00:18:29.670 --> 00:18:32.390
Please, Doctor.
I can't stand the pain.

00:18:32.500 --> 00:18:36.670
Do something.
- Please listen to me.

00:18:36.750 --> 00:18:40.540
I can't deliver the baby alone.
I am not an experienced doctor.

00:18:40.960 --> 00:18:42.500
I can't stand it.

00:18:45.210 --> 00:18:47.960
Okay, l-let me try something.

00:18:48.960 --> 00:18:51.030
I know an experienced doctor.

00:18:51.540 --> 00:18:53.340
I will call her here.

00:18:53.670 --> 00:18:55.090
Please wait until then.

00:18:56.540 --> 00:18:57.480
G-Give her the phone.

00:18:59.540 --> 00:19:01.290
Don't try to call the police.

00:19:02.080 --> 00:19:03.760
Just call the doctor.

00:19:04.330 --> 00:19:05.220
Oh, God..

00:19:17.210 --> 00:19:18.040
Hello.

00:19:18.290 --> 00:19:19.630
I-It's an emergency.

00:19:19.880 --> 00:19:21.110
Please come to the clinic quickly.

00:19:21.830 --> 00:19:23.840
Teju, what happened?
- Ma'am, please come quickly.

00:19:37.120 --> 00:19:38.380
Oh, God!

00:19:40.290 --> 00:19:41.630
It hurts too much..

00:19:47.420 --> 00:19:48.380
I can't..

00:19:48.620 --> 00:19:51.530
What happened, Teju? Why did you
ask me to come and cut the call?

00:19:52.040 --> 00:19:53.200
I can't stand the pain.

00:19:56.960 --> 00:19:57.900
Oh, God!

00:19:59.000 --> 00:19:59.870
I can't..

00:20:03.250 --> 00:20:04.410
Oh, Lord!

00:20:06.000 --> 00:20:07.160
This is the situation.

00:20:07.580 --> 00:20:09.730
I didn't know what to do
or whom to call.

00:20:10.750 --> 00:20:12.930
That's why I called you.
- It hurts!

00:20:14.010 --> 00:20:17.010
Look, there is no facility here.

00:20:17.670 --> 00:20:18.940
If you deliver the baby here,

00:20:18.980 --> 00:20:21.280
both the mother and the baby
will be in grave danger.

00:20:25.160 --> 00:20:26.380
I can't..

00:20:27.460 --> 00:20:28.500
Please..

00:20:29.080 --> 00:20:32.120
Please save my wife, Doctor!

00:20:33.540 --> 00:20:36.340
I beg you, Doctor.

00:20:36.960 --> 00:20:40.570
Please save my wife.
- What are you doing? Get up.

00:20:41.830 --> 00:20:43.220
I can't..

00:20:44.460 --> 00:20:46.690
It hurts too much..

00:20:59.580 --> 00:21:02.320
Sir, I have brought you some food.

00:21:04.170 --> 00:21:05.150
Keep it there.

00:21:05.790 --> 00:21:06.700
I am not hungry.

00:21:07.330 --> 00:21:08.350
I will eat later.

00:21:21.410 --> 00:21:24.290
Sir, you can take the medicine
only if you eat.

00:21:24.790 --> 00:21:26.230
Please have something.

00:21:29.410 --> 00:21:31.540
I have been watching you
for a month.

00:21:33.380 --> 00:21:34.870
You are always like this.

00:21:36.040 --> 00:21:38.590
I thought everything will be fine.

00:21:38.920 --> 00:21:41.470
But the situation is getting worse.

00:21:42.540 --> 00:21:46.660
You told Dr. Radhi about Reena
only because she was being rude.

00:21:47.620 --> 00:21:49.690
It's all because of Dr. Radhi.

00:21:50.960 --> 00:21:52.470
How could she
talk to you like that?

00:21:53.330 --> 00:21:55.720
Whatever it is,
I shouldn't have spoken that way.

00:21:57.170 --> 00:21:58.180
Don't justify it.

00:21:58.540 --> 00:22:01.030
Fine, what you did was wrong.

00:22:01.560 --> 00:22:04.090
But you've apologised
so many times.

00:22:05.120 --> 00:22:07.850
Do you think I don't know

00:22:08.520 --> 00:22:11.570
how you've been feeling about
Reena for the past one month?

00:22:12.210 --> 00:22:13.160
It's enough.

00:22:13.330 --> 00:22:17.930
You don't need that person
if they can't see your sincerity.

00:22:21.830 --> 00:22:26.360
Sir, I want to see you
like you used to be.

00:22:28.040 --> 00:22:32.340
If you continue to be like this,
I'm scared that you will suffer

00:22:33.830 --> 00:22:37.110
the same fate as your mother.

00:22:38.960 --> 00:22:41.410
It's enough.
Enough is enough.

00:23:55.429 --> 00:23:58.349
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

00:24:00.459 --> 00:24:03.099
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

00:24:05.549 --> 00:24:08.679
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

00:24:10.369 --> 00:24:12.629
♪ Our patience wins ♪

00:24:12.969 --> 00:24:15.279
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

00:24:15.599 --> 00:24:18.129
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

00:24:18.309 --> 00:24:20.869
♪ I am a doctor ♪

00:24:23.049 --> 00:24:25.799
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

00:24:28.039 --> 00:24:30.799
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

00:24:32.679 --> 00:24:36.859
♪ In it, I'm a doctor ♪

00:24:48.989 --> 00:24:50.929
Ma'am, you must deliver the baby.

00:24:51.539 --> 00:24:54.479
Teju, don't talk foolishly.
I have resigned.

00:24:55.929 --> 00:24:59.949
And I can't work in a hospital
or a clinic without an agreement.

00:25:00.239 --> 00:25:01.619
And look at this too.

00:25:02.059 --> 00:25:04.139
How can I work with this wound?

00:25:04.479 --> 00:25:07.009
This can cause an infection
to the mother and child.

00:25:07.659 --> 00:25:09.879
Ma'am, the patient
has fallen unconscious.

00:25:10.299 --> 00:25:12.829
Ma'am, if we delay,
her condition will be critical.

00:25:12.879 --> 00:25:14.079
Please do the delivery.

00:25:15.999 --> 00:25:17.759
Teju, you're saying the same thing
over and over again.

00:25:17.959 --> 00:25:19.619
Ma'am, we don't have
any other option.

00:25:21.219 --> 00:25:22.239
Please, Doctor.

00:25:23.639 --> 00:25:27.179
Let him see my child's face
at least once before leaving.

00:25:27.979 --> 00:25:30.739
I don't know
when I will see him again.

00:25:30.809 --> 00:25:33.369
Please, Doctor.

00:25:34.429 --> 00:25:35.319
Oh, God..

00:25:35.979 --> 00:25:36.979
Oh, no..

00:25:44.099 --> 00:25:45.279
Teju, I have an idea.

00:25:46.959 --> 00:25:49.449
I can't do it.
But you can do it, right?

00:26:02.309 --> 00:26:06.869
Ma'am, how can I do it?
I don't have any experience in this.

00:26:12.389 --> 00:26:14.379
We don't have
any other option, Teju.

00:26:14.639 --> 00:26:16.459
And they will help us, right?

00:26:26.329 --> 00:26:28.339
Teju, I know you.
You can do it.

00:26:29.059 --> 00:26:31.519
And throughout the process,
I will guide you, Teju.

00:26:31.769 --> 00:26:32.659
You can do it.

00:26:35.779 --> 00:26:38.719
Ma'am, what if her condition worsens
when I try to do something?

00:26:39.639 --> 00:26:42.449
Her condition will worsen
if we don't do anything now.

00:26:45.769 --> 00:26:47.309
So, you can do it bravely, Teju.

00:26:47.599 --> 00:26:51.429
Ma'am, we don't have any equipment
to deliver the baby here.

00:26:51.889 --> 00:26:53.379
It's okay.
We don't need anything big.

00:26:53.679 --> 00:26:56.779
Prepare an umbilical cord holder.
Or prepare two clips.

00:26:56.849 --> 00:26:58.689
And make sure
everything is sterilized.

00:26:59.019 --> 00:27:02.019
And for safety, get a vent plant,
IV fluid and IV set.

00:27:02.199 --> 00:27:03.639
Get as many painkillers
as you need.

00:27:04.889 --> 00:27:05.689
Okay, Doctor.

00:27:07.349 --> 00:27:08.569
Why do you need all that, Teju?

00:27:08.989 --> 00:27:11.929
Ma'am, just in case. What if
we have to do an episiotomy?

00:27:12.719 --> 00:27:13.549
Good.

00:27:16.349 --> 00:27:18.389
Okay, where do we deliver the baby?

00:27:38.929 --> 00:27:40.289
Oh, God!

00:27:41.769 --> 00:27:42.729
Oh, God..

00:27:45.309 --> 00:27:46.289
It hurts..

00:27:47.929 --> 00:27:48.829
I can't bear it.

00:27:52.059 --> 00:27:53.029
Oh, God..

00:27:58.769 --> 00:28:01.529
Oh, God, it hurts!

00:28:16.289 --> 00:28:18.559
It hurts so much..

00:28:23.639 --> 00:28:27.459
Doctor, I can't stand this..
- It's okay, be brave.

00:28:28.179 --> 00:28:30.929
Everything will be fine.
Take a deep breath.

00:28:32.019 --> 00:28:34.309
Relax and push. Push!

00:28:34.719 --> 00:28:35.549
Slowly.

00:28:36.809 --> 00:28:37.769
Push.

00:28:39.309 --> 00:28:42.059
Come on, push hard.
Brave the pain.

00:28:42.349 --> 00:28:45.399
Push hard. Try to push, come on.

00:28:46.559 --> 00:28:48.449
Take a deep breath and try to push.

00:28:48.499 --> 00:28:50.309
I can't do it, Doctor.
- Come on.

00:28:52.219 --> 00:28:53.339
Oh, God..

00:28:53.889 --> 00:28:57.169
Come on. No, no, no.
- I can't..

00:28:57.269 --> 00:28:59.519
Don't waste your energy.
Try to push.

00:28:59.769 --> 00:29:01.429
Push hard, come on.
- Oh, God..

00:29:01.559 --> 00:29:03.309
Don't fall unconscious..

00:29:03.429 --> 00:29:04.559
Open your eyes.

00:29:04.769 --> 00:29:06.449
Give her some oxytocin.
- Okay, Doctor.

00:29:06.549 --> 00:29:08.429
Look here, come on..

00:29:08.849 --> 00:29:10.839
Open your eyes.
Come on.

00:29:11.269 --> 00:29:12.069
Push.

00:29:13.719 --> 00:29:15.319
Push, push, push.
Push hard!

00:29:16.059 --> 00:29:17.289
You can do it, come on.

00:29:17.679 --> 00:29:19.199
Push hard.
- Ma'am.

00:29:19.479 --> 00:29:20.929
Push! Come on, push!

00:29:20.979 --> 00:29:21.849
Come on, push.
- Ma'am!

00:29:24.019 --> 00:29:25.779
I can see the head,
but I can't get it out.

00:29:27.669 --> 00:29:29.109
Give her a scalpel.
- Oh, God..

00:29:29.189 --> 00:29:30.229
What is that for?

00:29:30.479 --> 00:29:32.619
We don't have any other option,
Teju. We have to do the episiotomy.

00:29:35.349 --> 00:29:39.049
Ma'am, I've never done
an episiotomy before.

00:29:39.769 --> 00:29:41.789
We don't have any
other option, Teju. Do it.

00:29:43.929 --> 00:29:44.919
Oh, no.

00:29:46.889 --> 00:29:48.309
Ma'am, she can't bear the pain.

00:29:48.649 --> 00:29:50.169
Do we have to do the episiotomy?

00:29:51.129 --> 00:29:53.599
Her pain will be less than
what it is now, Teju. Do it.

00:29:55.849 --> 00:29:57.389
Ma'am, I'm very scared.

00:29:57.589 --> 00:29:59.629
If I do something,
it might get more complicated.

00:29:59.719 --> 00:30:01.489
No, Teju.
We don't have any other option.

00:30:02.119 --> 00:30:04.199
We have to save the mother
and the child. Do it, Teju.

00:30:05.099 --> 00:30:07.829
High time to take responsibility.
I trust you. Do it..

00:30:08.429 --> 00:30:10.139
You push. Push hard, come on.

00:30:10.769 --> 00:30:12.579
Teju, don't delay.
Go ahead.

00:30:14.349 --> 00:30:15.389
Push now.

00:30:16.179 --> 00:30:17.189
Push harder.

00:30:18.679 --> 00:30:21.679
Oh, God..
- Look here, look here. It's okay.

00:30:21.769 --> 00:30:22.929
Push now, come on.

00:30:23.349 --> 00:30:26.099
Don't waste your energy.
Just breathe in and push.

00:30:26.349 --> 00:30:29.039
You can do it.
Come on, push harder.

00:30:31.389 --> 00:30:33.779
You can do it, come on.
Devi, do it.

00:30:34.639 --> 00:30:36.639
Push harder, come on.

00:30:37.019 --> 00:30:39.589
Look, look, open your eyes.

00:30:39.979 --> 00:30:41.249
I can't do it.

00:30:42.059 --> 00:30:45.599
Come on, come on.
You can do it, come on.

00:30:45.709 --> 00:30:47.289
Come on, come on.
You can do it.

00:30:47.479 --> 00:30:49.869
I can't do it.. Doctor..
- Yes, you can.

00:30:49.919 --> 00:30:52.279
The baby is moving.
You have to co-operate.

00:30:53.349 --> 00:30:55.329
Oh, God!

00:32:27.719 --> 00:32:28.549
It's a baby girl.

00:32:37.659 --> 00:32:39.719
I don't know what kind
of a person you were till now.

00:32:40.849 --> 00:32:42.199
But from now on

00:32:43.559 --> 00:32:45.719
you have to lead a good life
for your daughter.

00:32:46.629 --> 00:32:48.729
I don't know
how to thank you, Doctor.

00:32:52.129 --> 00:32:53.629
She looks just like her mother.

00:33:09.679 --> 00:33:10.799
Good job, Teju.

00:33:14.019 --> 00:33:15.409
Even though I delivered the baby,

00:33:16.309 --> 00:33:17.899
you played a major role
by guiding me.

00:33:18.749 --> 00:33:19.569
Thank you.

00:33:30.389 --> 00:33:32.689
Sir, why are you asking me to do it?

00:33:40.219 --> 00:33:41.989
Look, how they have kept my bike.

00:33:42.569 --> 00:33:43.679
It's all because of you.

00:33:44.069 --> 00:33:45.529
Both our bikes
look good together, right?

00:33:47.349 --> 00:33:49.969
They'd keep
everyone's bike the same way.

00:33:50.059 --> 00:33:51.919
Look at my vehicle.
It's the same.

00:33:52.179 --> 00:33:53.939
I'm the one who paid your fine.

00:33:54.649 --> 00:33:56.419
I didn't want to thank you.

00:33:56.709 --> 00:33:57.629
That's why I didn't.

00:33:58.009 --> 00:33:59.079
Let it be.

00:33:59.129 --> 00:34:01.189
You have to return my money
as soon as you get the salary.

00:34:01.279 --> 00:34:02.799
Do you understand?
- Sure..

00:34:03.019 --> 00:34:05.769
I will definitely
return your money, Reena.

00:34:11.769 --> 00:34:12.749
Start the vehicle.

00:34:14.349 --> 00:34:15.239
Shall I help you?

00:34:20.979 --> 00:34:22.409
Hello, tell me.

00:34:24.309 --> 00:34:26.529
I'm leaving.
I'll be there in 10 minutes.

00:34:26.889 --> 00:34:28.369
They just gave me the keys.

00:34:28.639 --> 00:34:30.509
They delayed me inside.

00:34:31.269 --> 00:34:33.049
Oh, no!
- Oh, no!

00:34:33.209 --> 00:34:34.109
I'm sorry.

00:34:34.459 --> 00:34:36.939
I'm sorry. I didn't mean
to hit you. I'm sorry.

00:34:37.009 --> 00:34:39.689
You've hit my bike so early in
the day. Is it enough to say sorry?

00:34:39.809 --> 00:34:41.629
Don't you have any sense?
Why weren't you careful?

00:34:42.429 --> 00:34:44.979
Bro! She is saying that
she didn't mean to hit you.

00:34:45.869 --> 00:34:47.439
Is she your lover?

00:34:47.949 --> 00:34:50.849
So you hit my bike during
your lovers' quarrel, is it?

00:34:51.849 --> 00:34:54.129
Nothing happened to your vehicle,
right? Then what?

00:34:54.609 --> 00:34:56.009
What did you say, you rascal?

00:34:56.529 --> 00:34:58.429
Stop irritating me and get lost.

00:34:58.569 --> 00:34:59.369
You little..

00:34:59.589 --> 00:35:01.229
Hey!
- Don't use profanity.

00:35:02.139 --> 00:35:02.979
Hey!

00:35:03.229 --> 00:35:04.569
You hit me, right?

00:35:04.839 --> 00:35:06.019
I'll show you who I am.

00:35:06.719 --> 00:35:07.579
Hey!

00:35:07.709 --> 00:35:11.029
I hit you again. Tell me.
Who are you? What will you do?

00:35:11.139 --> 00:35:13.169
You wait right here.
I'll get my men.

00:35:13.849 --> 00:35:14.719
Move aside, Reena.

00:35:15.309 --> 00:35:17.989
Hey! Kiran! What are you doing?
- Go on, get your men.

00:35:18.059 --> 00:35:19.059
Kiran..

00:35:20.559 --> 00:35:22.999
Kiran, he might actually bring
someone here. Let's go, come on.

00:35:23.139 --> 00:35:24.369
Why should we go?
- Where are you guys?

00:35:24.429 --> 00:35:26.059
Let him bring them.
- Come to the police station.

00:35:26.169 --> 00:35:28.269
We're late to the hospital.
Come on, let's go.

00:35:28.889 --> 00:35:30.139
Why should we go?

00:35:30.599 --> 00:35:33.139
Don't create unnecessary problems.
Are you coming or not?

00:35:34.369 --> 00:35:35.609
Start the vehicle, go.

00:35:56.909 --> 00:36:00.009
What happened, Radhi?
You look different today.

00:36:00.409 --> 00:36:02.079
No, there's nothing.

00:36:02.319 --> 00:36:05.589
No, you look very happy today.
That's why I asked.

00:36:06.269 --> 00:36:07.499
Is that so?
- Yes.

00:36:07.979 --> 00:36:08.959
That's a secret.

00:36:09.439 --> 00:36:10.499
What secret?

00:36:12.339 --> 00:36:14.579
I got a call last night, right?

00:36:14.639 --> 00:36:15.459
Yes.

00:36:15.509 --> 00:36:19.179
I went to help a doctor friend
in a pregnancy case.

00:36:19.889 --> 00:36:23.849
Even though I just helped, I
feel like I did the surgery myself.

00:36:23.959 --> 00:36:26.289
That's why I'm happy.
- Super, Mom.

00:36:30.119 --> 00:36:31.999
You like to do that, right?

00:36:32.219 --> 00:36:36.049
If you feel happy doing that,
then you should do that, right?

00:36:40.459 --> 00:36:42.199
Okay. Eat fast.
It's getting late.

00:36:42.719 --> 00:36:43.639
Divi!

00:36:44.519 --> 00:36:45.939
I'll drop you off at school today.

00:36:47.869 --> 00:36:50.479
No. I'm free today. I'll drop her.

00:36:51.189 --> 00:36:53.629
I'm going that way anyway.
I'll drop her.

00:36:54.229 --> 00:36:55.899
Okay, Dad.
- Shall we go?

00:36:56.489 --> 00:36:57.399
Yes.

00:36:59.429 --> 00:37:00.409
Bye, Mom.

00:37:19.319 --> 00:37:20.149
Doctor!

00:37:21.639 --> 00:37:25.309
Mr. Arjun asked me to tell everyone
that they should not be late.

00:37:26.899 --> 00:37:29.039
Did he ask you to tell me
when I'm walking in?

00:37:29.389 --> 00:37:32.059
No, Doctor. He asked me
to tell anyone who comes late.

00:37:32.419 --> 00:37:34.939
I saw you
and Dr. Kiran coming in late.

00:37:35.229 --> 00:37:36.689
That's why I told you.

00:37:36.929 --> 00:37:39.349
So what if we are late?
What will they do?

00:37:39.769 --> 00:37:42.499
He asked me to note down
those who are regularly late.

00:37:42.599 --> 00:37:43.469
And then?

00:37:44.679 --> 00:37:50.729
He asked me to fine those
who come late regularly.

00:37:52.699 --> 00:37:53.799
What's this?

00:37:53.959 --> 00:37:55.629
You're behaving like school kids.

00:37:56.459 --> 00:37:58.149
It wasn't so strict
even in my school.

00:37:58.459 --> 00:38:01.439
No, Doctor.
I just told you what Mr. Arjun said.

00:38:02.479 --> 00:38:05.469
I feel like he's doing this
to target someone in particular.

00:38:06.119 --> 00:38:07.839
I didn't target
anyone in particular.

00:38:10.019 --> 00:38:11.479
And that's not my intention.

00:38:12.069 --> 00:38:13.449
Then what is it?

00:38:14.229 --> 00:38:16.559
Latecomers used to get punished
when Dr. Radhi was here.

00:38:16.679 --> 00:38:18.779
She'd never deduct
a fine from our salaries.

00:38:18.959 --> 00:38:19.999
What's with this new rule?

00:38:20.149 --> 00:38:22.999
The staff should not come late
to the hospital.

00:38:24.679 --> 00:38:27.999
It's an old rule
to fine the latecomers.

00:38:28.399 --> 00:38:30.649
I don't know why Dr. Radhi
didn't take the rule seriously.

00:38:31.529 --> 00:38:35.729
But from now on,
it will be followed strictly.

00:38:37.019 --> 00:38:37.839
Okay, sir.

00:38:38.429 --> 00:38:40.169
We'll be on time from now on.

00:38:43.029 --> 00:38:45.369
If anyone finds it difficult
to follow this rule,

00:38:45.569 --> 00:38:48.679
ask them to give a resignation
letter and join another hospital.

00:38:49.489 --> 00:38:50.479
If they stay here

00:38:51.869 --> 00:38:54.179
there are certain rules
for RK Hospital.

00:38:55.859 --> 00:38:57.119
They must follow them.

00:39:07.809 --> 00:39:10.119
Rocky, did you finish
the diagnosis?

00:39:10.979 --> 00:39:12.059
Oh, God..

00:39:12.529 --> 00:39:14.649
I'm stuck with Nilofer.

00:39:15.349 --> 00:39:18.429
I don't know
how to escape from her.

00:39:18.979 --> 00:39:22.769
She's convincing me
that what she says is right.

00:39:25.309 --> 00:39:26.849
I have to go and meet her
after coffee.

00:39:27.219 --> 00:39:29.549
Only then will I know the status.

00:39:32.809 --> 00:39:33.679
Hi, Reena.

00:39:35.549 --> 00:39:37.649
What's the matter, Reena?
You look upset.

00:39:38.059 --> 00:39:39.079
Don't get me started.

00:39:39.359 --> 00:39:41.839
I went to the police station
with Kiran and got my bike.

00:39:42.059 --> 00:39:43.519
That's why I came late.

00:39:43.679 --> 00:39:46.709
Oh! Otherwise, you wouldn't
have come late. Isn't it?

00:39:46.779 --> 00:39:47.639
Rocky!

00:39:48.679 --> 00:39:50.479
That's really why I was late today.

00:39:50.599 --> 00:39:52.099
As soon as I entered the hospital

00:39:52.169 --> 00:39:54.289
your friend is asking me
to pay a fine for coming late.

00:39:54.379 --> 00:39:55.299
Not only that

00:39:55.349 --> 00:39:58.369
he's asking me to resign
if I can't follow the new rules.

00:39:58.439 --> 00:40:00.799
Not only you,
everyone was told the same thing.

00:40:01.219 --> 00:40:03.309
Thank God, I came on time today.

00:40:03.999 --> 00:40:06.159
Yes, even I was told
the same thing.

00:40:07.249 --> 00:40:08.549
If you two have a problem

00:40:08.599 --> 00:40:10.159
why can't you solve it
among yourselves?

00:40:10.419 --> 00:40:13.519
Asking us to pay a fine
for coming late..

00:40:13.569 --> 00:40:14.819
We'll suffer because of you.

00:40:18.029 --> 00:40:19.799
Okay, don't get tense.

00:40:20.499 --> 00:40:21.639
Are you done with the diagnosis?

00:40:22.659 --> 00:40:23.499
No.

00:40:24.139 --> 00:40:27.259
It took me two hours to go
to the police station.

00:40:27.959 --> 00:40:29.539
I've managed to do something.

00:40:29.639 --> 00:40:31.619
I gave some work to Kiran.
Let's see.

00:40:31.819 --> 00:40:33.849
Guna, are you done?
- Yes.

00:40:34.559 --> 00:40:35.399
Almost done.

00:40:36.559 --> 00:40:37.779
Who? Him.

00:40:39.019 --> 00:40:40.999
Naveen and Kamal
would've done it together.

00:40:41.119 --> 00:40:43.379
They both should've
formed a team separately.

00:40:46.809 --> 00:40:48.179
What is this, senior?

00:40:48.309 --> 00:40:49.649
He's a senior resident.

00:40:50.139 --> 00:40:52.549
Naveen and Kamal
are working in his team.

00:40:52.719 --> 00:40:54.289
He's the one who guides them.

00:40:54.889 --> 00:40:55.719
As if!

00:40:56.609 --> 00:40:59.689
He became the senior resident
only because Teju left.

00:41:00.219 --> 00:41:03.059
If she was here, she would've
been the senior resident. - Correct.

00:41:09.219 --> 00:41:10.989
Hey, have some samosas!
- Shut up.

00:41:13.789 --> 00:41:15.919
Are you done with the diagnosis?

00:41:16.059 --> 00:41:17.459
Not yet, almost there.

00:41:18.099 --> 00:41:19.379
I thought
you would've done it by now.

00:41:19.709 --> 00:41:23.379
Kiran was here. I was talking
to him about the diagnosis.

00:41:25.619 --> 00:41:27.899
Why do you smile
every time you say his name?

00:41:28.589 --> 00:41:31.779
Have you ever questioned the injustice
or fought for it?

00:41:31.889 --> 00:41:34.139
Why should I do that?
Am I a fool?

00:41:34.309 --> 00:41:36.889
Did he say that he does it?

00:41:37.629 --> 00:41:38.809
He said a few things.

00:41:39.019 --> 00:41:41.929
We saw him fighting
with those college boys.

00:41:42.819 --> 00:41:46.889
Yes, we saw him fighting
with the college boys.

00:41:47.439 --> 00:41:49.469
But I have a doubt.
- What is it?

00:41:50.349 --> 00:41:52.399
Why did he come
to Dr. Ramanadhan's room?

00:41:52.479 --> 00:41:53.339
To look for Reena.

00:41:53.719 --> 00:41:54.679
That's what he said.

00:41:54.869 --> 00:41:57.269
But he knows
that Reena wouldn't be there.

00:41:57.939 --> 00:42:00.869
How did he come at the right
time when we were treating him?

00:42:04.119 --> 00:42:07.239
On the first day
when he came with the injury,

00:42:07.459 --> 00:42:08.999
he told a story about it.

00:42:09.559 --> 00:42:10.659
You were the only one who saw it.

00:42:10.709 --> 00:42:13.189
But no one knows what
happened to the injury.

00:42:13.979 --> 00:42:17.269
But it was believable.
- That's only for you.

00:42:18.219 --> 00:42:23.339
I feel that he wants
to project himself as a hero.

00:42:23.769 --> 00:42:25.309
But I don't think that's real.

00:42:26.959 --> 00:42:28.049
You do something.

00:42:28.099 --> 00:42:30.519
Think about what he has told us
from the beginning.

00:42:31.249 --> 00:42:32.209
You'll understand.

00:42:37.789 --> 00:42:39.279
Hey, what are you doing?

00:42:40.889 --> 00:42:41.759
Can't you see?

00:42:42.809 --> 00:42:44.039
I'm looking at the case file.

00:42:44.649 --> 00:42:46.579
Isn't this the case that
Dr. Preetham gave? Give it to me.

00:42:46.929 --> 00:42:48.319
Are you done with the diagnosis?

00:42:48.709 --> 00:42:50.129
That's what I was doing.

00:42:51.539 --> 00:42:55.149
The patient is already cardiac and
diabetic. What have you diagnosed?

00:42:56.409 --> 00:42:58.649
You took the case file
before I could do my work.

00:42:58.809 --> 00:43:00.269
You've been sitting
on this for half an hour.

00:43:00.429 --> 00:43:03.589
You haven't diagnosed anything yet.
Come here, I'll help you.

00:43:04.019 --> 00:43:05.689
We can treat this case
in two or three ways.

00:43:05.749 --> 00:43:07.739
But we can't do it
without surgical intervention.

00:43:08.149 --> 00:43:09.829
I would suggest you to go

00:43:09.879 --> 00:43:10.829
for a discectomy..
- Did I ask you for help?

00:43:14.679 --> 00:43:17.299
Did I ask you to come and help me?

00:43:19.379 --> 00:43:21.159
Okay. Don't shout.

00:43:21.239 --> 00:43:22.659
Why are you shouting now?

00:43:25.059 --> 00:43:26.979
You spoke this way in front
of everyone at the canteen too.

00:43:27.939 --> 00:43:29.069
Give me the file.

00:43:31.109 --> 00:43:33.239
Don't try to dominate everyone.

00:43:34.979 --> 00:43:36.349
Guna.. Hey!

00:44:50.996 --> 00:44:53.916
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

00:44:56.026 --> 00:44:58.666
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

00:45:01.116 --> 00:45:04.246
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

00:45:05.936 --> 00:45:08.196
♪ Our patience wins ♪

00:45:08.536 --> 00:45:10.846
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

00:45:11.176 --> 00:45:13.696
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

00:45:13.886 --> 00:45:16.446
♪ I am a doctor ♪

00:45:18.616 --> 00:45:21.366
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

00:45:23.616 --> 00:45:26.366
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

00:45:28.246 --> 00:45:32.436
♪ In it, I'm a doctor ♪

00:45:44.746 --> 00:45:45.936
Did you see the case..
- Hi, guys!

00:45:45.986 --> 00:45:48.106
Sir..
- Hey, sit, sit, sit!

00:45:48.516 --> 00:45:49.386
Okay, sit, sit.

00:45:50.126 --> 00:45:52.186
Guys, did you
evaluate the situation?

00:45:52.386 --> 00:45:53.686
We don't have much time, okay?

00:45:53.986 --> 00:45:55.696
The patient's vitals
are getting worse.

00:45:55.776 --> 00:45:57.366
Who goes first? Yeah.
- Sir.

00:45:57.946 --> 00:45:59.486
Sir, after seeing the MRI reports

00:45:59.596 --> 00:46:00.996
and studying the patient's details

00:46:01.036 --> 00:46:03.666
Rocky and I have decided
to do a spinal fusion.

00:46:04.366 --> 00:46:07.056
Because our priority
is the patient's stabilisation.

00:46:07.286 --> 00:46:09.316
So through spinal fusion,
we can do that.

00:46:09.376 --> 00:46:11.156
Since we fuse the two bones
that are in pain

00:46:11.206 --> 00:46:12.526
We can save him
from a lot of pain.

00:46:12.626 --> 00:46:14.126
So, a spinal fusion would work.

00:46:14.256 --> 00:46:15.116
Okay..

00:46:16.336 --> 00:46:18.926
But, sir, it's not that easy.

00:46:20.096 --> 00:46:22.026
You may be able to fix that bone.

00:46:22.306 --> 00:46:24.106
But when you fuse that bone

00:46:24.176 --> 00:46:27.216
vibrations will be transferred to
nearby bones due to motor pressure.

00:46:27.626 --> 00:46:29.296
So, within a few months

00:46:29.356 --> 00:46:32.376
there are many chances for the
patient's body to become weak.

00:46:33.986 --> 00:46:35.236
I think so too, sir.

00:46:36.226 --> 00:46:37.906
So, what do you propose, Reena?

00:46:37.986 --> 00:46:40.086
Sir, I propose disruptonomy, sir.

00:46:40.186 --> 00:46:43.036
Comparatively, it's an easy
and safe procedure.

00:46:43.156 --> 00:46:45.576
Because there is a nerve root

00:46:45.626 --> 00:46:47.266
between two discs
in the patient's spine.

00:46:47.506 --> 00:46:50.066
Due to the pressure of the tissues,
the nerve continues to get damaged.

00:46:50.376 --> 00:46:51.536
So, what I'm saying is

00:46:51.596 --> 00:46:54.156
we can safely remove
the herniated spinal disc, sir.

00:46:54.256 --> 00:46:56.906
Reena, will it be that effective?

00:46:57.946 --> 00:47:00.236
When we look at the scans,
the bulge is small.

00:47:00.756 --> 00:47:02.966
But when we look
at the patient's suffering

00:47:03.016 --> 00:47:04.896
I think the damage is more severe.

00:47:06.346 --> 00:47:08.206
But, Guna, we can only depend
on the scans, right?

00:47:08.516 --> 00:47:11.266
Pain tolerance will be
different for each patient, right?

00:47:11.356 --> 00:47:12.616
Very good point, Reena.

00:47:12.996 --> 00:47:14.826
Guna, what's your team's plan?

00:47:15.236 --> 00:47:17.896
Sir, actually, Reena's method is good.

00:47:17.966 --> 00:47:21.836
But we don't think the bulge
in the patient's bone will stop

00:47:22.576 --> 00:47:23.406
with just one bone, sir.

00:47:23.656 --> 00:47:25.706
So, we strongly suggest laminating.
- Yes, sir.

00:47:26.216 --> 00:47:28.796
But..
- Yes, it's a big procedure.

00:47:29.416 --> 00:47:30.496
But I think it's necessary.

00:47:31.186 --> 00:47:33.736
Sir, we can remove
the whole vertebral bone.

00:47:34.336 --> 00:47:36.216
And then we can do
the artificial disc replacement.

00:47:36.796 --> 00:47:39.426
I'm saying this because, we
shouldn't consider only the bulge

00:47:39.796 --> 00:47:41.706
we should consider
the nerve prolapse also, sir.

00:47:43.826 --> 00:47:44.826
Very good, guys.

00:47:45.146 --> 00:47:46.556
You've studied in detail.

00:47:46.736 --> 00:47:48.386
I like the amount
of work you've put in.

00:47:50.306 --> 00:47:52.186
Guna, your team's plan
is very good.

00:47:52.796 --> 00:47:53.986
Proven method also.

00:47:54.316 --> 00:47:55.936
But in this case, it's an overkill.

00:47:56.566 --> 00:47:58.256
But.. spinal fusion.

00:47:58.816 --> 00:48:00.806
Do you know
how many complications there are?

00:48:01.406 --> 00:48:03.396
Do you know how much pain
and suffering it will radiate?

00:48:03.866 --> 00:48:07.266
So, in this case, I think we'll go
with Reena's team's plan.

00:48:07.876 --> 00:48:09.126
It's a balanced method.

00:48:09.296 --> 00:48:11.326
And we shouldn't overdo it.

00:48:11.446 --> 00:48:12.716
And we shouldn't underdo it either.

00:48:13.456 --> 00:48:15.836
So, Reena and Kiran,
get ready for the surgery.

00:48:16.166 --> 00:48:17.026
Thank you, sir.
- Yes, sir.

00:48:18.336 --> 00:48:19.776
Leave it. We'll do it next time.
- Awesome, Reena.

00:48:20.086 --> 00:48:21.556
Enough.
- You cracked it so well.

00:48:26.986 --> 00:48:27.926
Hey!
- Yes?

00:48:28.806 --> 00:48:30.036
Are you not coming?
- I'm coming.

00:48:30.426 --> 00:48:31.746
Hey, shall we go?
- Come on.

00:48:35.226 --> 00:48:38.256
Since this is the first case,
our interns are excited, right?

00:48:38.386 --> 00:48:39.946
Rocky!
- Yes, senior?

00:48:40.366 --> 00:48:42.306
What happened in the meeting?
- The meeting?

00:48:42.486 --> 00:48:44.336
Actually, this case should have
come to my team.

00:48:45.026 --> 00:48:46.086
But we just missed it.

00:48:46.236 --> 00:48:47.366
It went to Reena's team.

00:48:50.286 --> 00:48:51.166
That's why.

00:48:51.206 --> 00:48:53.996
If someone with experience
offers to help you

00:48:54.106 --> 00:48:56.446
you should keep your ego aside
and accept it.

00:48:57.026 --> 00:48:59.446
Otherwise, you'll lose everything.

00:48:59.966 --> 00:49:00.836
Oh!

00:49:01.086 --> 00:49:02.066
By the way, senior..

00:49:02.506 --> 00:49:06.486
Who wanted to help whom
and who is being egotistical?

00:49:08.716 --> 00:49:09.986
What happened to him?

00:49:14.326 --> 00:49:15.826
What's happening here?

00:49:55.656 --> 00:49:57.966
Heart rate is fluctuating, sir.

00:49:58.766 --> 00:50:01.106
Okay.
- Okay, Reena.

00:50:01.276 --> 00:50:02.756
The situation is very bad.

00:50:03.066 --> 00:50:06.826
The disc is more affected
than we thought. - Sir..

00:50:06.946 --> 00:50:08.796
Okay, guys.
This is getting very complicated.

00:50:09.026 --> 00:50:10.426
Let's start patching him up.

00:50:10.486 --> 00:50:11.546
This is not working.

00:50:11.906 --> 00:50:13.456
We need to plan this better.
Come on.

00:50:18.376 --> 00:50:20.336
The situation is worse
than we thought.

00:50:20.416 --> 00:50:23.646
It's more affected
than the herniated disc we found.

00:50:23.836 --> 00:50:25.766
Fortunately,
cervical is absolutely fine.

00:50:26.016 --> 00:50:28.286
Sir, my plan will be right
for the circumstances.

00:50:28.506 --> 00:50:30.006
We can easily replace
the whole bone structure

00:50:30.056 --> 00:50:31.386
with artificial bone replacement.

00:50:31.506 --> 00:50:32.496
We can easily do that.

00:50:32.956 --> 00:50:35.206
Guna, there are many complications
in what you're saying.

00:50:35.266 --> 00:50:37.596
This could lead to kyphosis
and scoliosis in the future.

00:50:37.676 --> 00:50:39.106
These are its side effects, right?

00:50:39.806 --> 00:50:41.116
Reena, what you're saying is right.

00:50:41.176 --> 00:50:42.696
But what choice
do we have right now?

00:50:43.066 --> 00:50:44.746
Sir, we have to save
the patient first.

00:50:44.856 --> 00:50:47.026
And then we can deal
with the side effects later.

00:50:50.746 --> 00:50:51.586
Right.

00:50:51.696 --> 00:50:53.926
Guna and team will replace
Reena and team in surgery.

00:50:54.076 --> 00:50:55.716
Let's get started right away.
Okay?

00:51:13.136 --> 00:51:15.266
He did well, right?
- He nailed it.

00:51:16.566 --> 00:51:18.556
You have a good teamwork.
- Yes, sir.

00:51:18.686 --> 00:51:20.146
Thank you, sir.
- But that's not enough.

00:51:20.326 --> 00:51:21.226
Okay?
- Yes, sir.

00:51:21.356 --> 00:51:22.866
Guna.
- Sir?

00:51:23.226 --> 00:51:24.776
You led the surgery
and proceed well.

00:51:25.206 --> 00:51:26.106
Very well.

00:51:26.276 --> 00:51:27.096
Thank you, sir.

00:51:27.146 --> 00:51:28.396
Good job, guys.
- Thank you, sir..

00:51:30.446 --> 00:51:33.306
Guna, give me your hand.
You did it so well as he said.

00:51:33.706 --> 00:51:35.046
He did it well, right?
- Thanks, man.

00:51:35.126 --> 00:51:36.526
You rocked it, dude.
- Thanks, dude.

00:51:37.456 --> 00:51:39.196
Alright.
- Shall we have some tea?

00:51:39.666 --> 00:51:41.756
There's a patient nearby.
I'll go and see him.

00:51:54.656 --> 00:51:55.986
You're much better now.

00:51:56.096 --> 00:51:57.906
We'll discharge you when the
doctor comes in the evening.

00:51:57.976 --> 00:51:58.816
Okay.
- Take care.

00:51:59.816 --> 00:52:02.376
Oh, no.
Hey! I got scared.

00:52:02.486 --> 00:52:04.866
Why are you standing like this?
- I came casually.

00:52:05.566 --> 00:52:08.406
I wanted to ask you earlier.
I forgot because of the meeting.

00:52:08.776 --> 00:52:09.856
Why were you late this morning?

00:52:10.236 --> 00:52:11.436
Oh, that?

00:52:11.566 --> 00:52:12.886
That's a fatal incident.

00:52:13.006 --> 00:52:14.466
I got late trying to solve it.

00:52:15.236 --> 00:52:16.176
Incident?

00:52:17.036 --> 00:52:17.856
Yes.

00:52:18.086 --> 00:52:19.616
I went to the police station
yesterday to get my bike back.

00:52:20.246 --> 00:52:21.416
I paid the fine.

00:52:21.446 --> 00:52:26.466
When I was coming back with
the bike.. I hit a bike slightly.

00:52:26.956 --> 00:52:28.356
He started fighting.

00:52:29.426 --> 00:52:30.796
I slapped him.

00:52:30.966 --> 00:52:32.416
He started hitting me again.

00:52:33.046 --> 00:52:35.896
I defended myself
and hit him again.

00:52:36.386 --> 00:52:37.886
He went to bring his men.

00:52:38.136 --> 00:52:40.136
Wait. Shall I continue the story?

00:52:40.386 --> 00:52:42.146
He would have gone
to bring his men.

00:52:42.226 --> 00:52:43.596
And you would have been waiting.

00:52:43.676 --> 00:52:45.246
But you were running late for work

00:52:45.356 --> 00:52:47.186
so you would have left.
Am I right?

00:52:48.276 --> 00:52:51.736
You used to listen to my stories,
now you are making fun of me.

00:52:51.906 --> 00:52:54.456
No one in this hospital
believed your stories.

00:52:54.776 --> 00:52:57.096
Now you are telling a story
which even I can't believe.

00:52:57.406 --> 00:52:58.696
I am doubting you.

00:52:59.406 --> 00:53:01.776
I think you should work
on your storytelling.

00:53:01.866 --> 00:53:03.306
Hey, if you don't believe me..

00:53:03.406 --> 00:53:04.996
No, I believe you.
Work on it..

00:53:06.586 --> 00:53:07.446
Fine, go.

00:53:14.966 --> 00:53:17.076
Hey, why did you smirk?

00:53:19.146 --> 00:53:20.066
I am asking you.

00:53:20.326 --> 00:53:21.566
Why did you smirk
like you were mocking me?

00:53:22.376 --> 00:53:23.676
It wasn't to mock you.

00:53:24.196 --> 00:53:29.366
I smirked to show you that I
have done what you said I can't do.

00:53:33.116 --> 00:53:36.296
Anitha, you are dominating me.

00:53:37.366 --> 00:53:39.806
You are treating me
as if I am incapable of anything.

00:53:40.506 --> 00:53:44.266
And you are treating me as if I
can't do anything without you.

00:53:44.616 --> 00:53:48.196
I came to the nurses' station
to help you.

00:53:50.666 --> 00:53:52.126
If you came to help me

00:53:52.176 --> 00:53:55.446
why didn't you take it as a sport
when I said I don't want your help?

00:53:57.546 --> 00:53:59.716
When they said that
Reena's evaluation was accepted

00:53:59.846 --> 00:54:02.506
you said that I didn't take
your help because of my ego.

00:54:03.056 --> 00:54:03.976
Do you know why?

00:54:04.306 --> 00:54:06.546
You are angry
that I didn't accept what you said.

00:54:09.086 --> 00:54:11.176
Before that, you were saying

00:54:11.346 --> 00:54:14.026
that I am incapable in front
of everyone in the canteen.

00:54:14.136 --> 00:54:17.106
You said that I became a senior
resident because Teju is not here.

00:54:17.236 --> 00:54:18.906
If this is not dominating, what is?

00:54:19.986 --> 00:54:22.356
Oh God!
I was just pulling your leg, man.

00:54:22.536 --> 00:54:25.556
You should do it
in a way that doesn't hurt others.

00:54:28.336 --> 00:54:29.236
This relationship..

00:54:36.966 --> 00:54:40.796
Everything is going as per your wish
since this relationship started.

00:54:41.886 --> 00:54:45.206
Even the fact that our relationship
is a secret in this hospital.

00:54:47.646 --> 00:54:49.026
I am asking you one thing.

00:54:49.356 --> 00:54:51.486
You are humiliating me
in front of everyone.

00:54:51.856 --> 00:54:53.066
I am a senior resident.

00:54:53.646 --> 00:54:56.696
Have you ever thought
about what they'd think about me?

00:54:58.486 --> 00:55:02.946
You felt bad that everyone started
looking at us when I raised my voice

00:55:03.326 --> 00:55:04.836
at the nurses' station, right?

00:55:05.356 --> 00:55:06.436
Isn't it the same for me?

00:55:09.076 --> 00:55:10.626
Guna, let me explain first.

00:55:12.336 --> 00:55:13.646
What are you going to explain?

00:55:14.756 --> 00:55:16.496
Even now,
you'll talk about yourself.

00:55:19.126 --> 00:55:24.026
I think Ravi didn't accept you
because he knew this side of you.

00:55:29.476 --> 00:55:31.616
Talk only about us.

00:55:33.646 --> 00:55:35.546
You have no right
to talk about my past.

00:55:46.406 --> 00:55:47.386
What is this, sir?

00:55:48.456 --> 00:55:50.286
The hospital expenses are so high.

00:55:50.496 --> 00:55:52.196
Why are the machine services
so expensive?

00:55:56.756 --> 00:55:59.626
The medical costs have increased
so much compared to the last time.

00:55:59.896 --> 00:56:02.826
Sir, we did it after getting
approval from the chief doctor.

00:56:02.996 --> 00:56:04.386
It will come to you
only at the end.

00:56:04.486 --> 00:56:05.306
He is new.

00:56:07.306 --> 00:56:12.276
You know better than him
about the expenses of the hospital.

00:56:12.406 --> 00:56:14.756
Sir, the hospital is crowded now.

00:56:16.066 --> 00:56:18.396
No, something is not right.

00:56:20.946 --> 00:56:22.926
The hospital has seen
a bigger crowd than this before.

00:56:23.226 --> 00:56:24.336
It has never been a problem before.

00:56:31.036 --> 00:56:33.436
The insurance claim amount
is also high.

00:56:33.706 --> 00:56:35.746
The amount to be charged
to the patients is also high.

00:56:35.836 --> 00:56:38.486
Sir, the full insurance amount
doesn't get claimed.

00:56:39.416 --> 00:56:42.916
But still, the cost
of the treatment is twice as high.

00:56:44.276 --> 00:56:46.726
Sir, even if we try to cover it

00:56:46.816 --> 00:56:50.486
the doctors demand
all the tests and scans

00:56:50.556 --> 00:56:52.916
even to those clinical patients
who don't need it.

00:56:53.076 --> 00:56:54.606
But it was not like that before.

00:56:54.896 --> 00:56:58.526
The patients would get only
the necessary tests and treatments.

00:56:59.076 --> 00:57:01.246
On top of that,
there was a surgery today.

00:57:01.566 --> 00:57:03.776
Initially, they started
with a procedure.

00:57:03.956 --> 00:57:05.766
They said there were
some complications

00:57:05.816 --> 00:57:07.526
and continued with
another procedure.

00:57:07.656 --> 00:57:09.516
Even that increased the expenses.

00:57:11.746 --> 00:57:13.286
Who were in the team
that did the surgery?

00:57:28.806 --> 00:57:30.336
Before doing a surgery

00:57:30.846 --> 00:57:34.396
can't you study the details and go
ahead with the correct procedures?

00:57:38.116 --> 00:57:41.126
You went into the OT
and then faced complications

00:57:41.196 --> 00:57:42.826
so you decided on another procedure.

00:57:46.906 --> 00:57:49.506
Who will answer if something
happens to the patient?

00:57:51.926 --> 00:57:53.836
Also, why did you
ask the clinical patients

00:57:53.886 --> 00:57:55.716
to take so many
scans unnecessarily?

00:57:55.966 --> 00:57:57.976
Can't they diagnose that properly?

00:57:59.246 --> 00:58:00.926
Do you know how
the hospital bills have increased

00:58:00.966 --> 00:58:02.156
because of taking so
many tests and scans?

00:58:02.836 --> 00:58:05.326
Why are you looking at me
as if I did all this?

00:58:05.656 --> 00:58:09.306
Your concern over high hospital
expenses is justified.

00:58:09.636 --> 00:58:11.026
But you are asking the wrong person.

00:58:11.176 --> 00:58:13.226
Dr. Preetham was the one who
proceeded with the surgery.

00:58:13.306 --> 00:58:15.236
We just pitched
our evaluation to him.

00:58:15.346 --> 00:58:18.006
He was the one who decided which
procedure to go ahead with

00:58:18.056 --> 00:58:18.926
and not us.

00:58:19.016 --> 00:58:20.216
No matter how prepared we are

00:58:20.256 --> 00:58:22.326
if there is a complication
in the surgery

00:58:22.396 --> 00:58:25.426
the procedure has to be
changed to save the life.

00:58:26.526 --> 00:58:29.726
Don't bring personal grudges
into professional issues.

00:58:30.146 --> 00:58:30.976
What?

00:58:31.156 --> 00:58:32.866
That's why you have made a rule
for latecomers.

00:58:32.966 --> 00:58:34.636
Now you are accusing me of this.

00:58:34.706 --> 00:58:35.506
Hello, hello.

00:58:35.826 --> 00:58:37.726
All this is for the sake
of the hospital only.

00:58:38.936 --> 00:58:41.906
I have called you all here
for the wellness of the hospital.

00:58:43.016 --> 00:58:45.846
I will see what I can do
with the input you give.

00:58:46.676 --> 00:58:48.286
Apart from that,
there is nothing personal.

00:58:48.546 --> 00:58:50.366
And I didn't accuse anyone.

00:58:52.096 --> 00:58:55.056
You are unnecessarily taking
this personally and fighting.

00:58:58.976 --> 00:59:00.366
And for your kind information

00:59:00.646 --> 00:59:03.806
I didn't set the rule that you
shouldn't come late to work.

00:59:04.276 --> 00:59:08.316
The rule is already common
to everyone in the hospital.

00:59:17.666 --> 00:59:20.226
Hereafter, be careful about the
surgeries and the clinical patients.

00:59:22.546 --> 00:59:23.666
I will talk
to Dr. Preetham as well.

00:59:24.666 --> 00:59:25.496
You guys may leave.

00:59:41.376 --> 00:59:42.576
How arrogant he is!

00:59:42.856 --> 00:59:43.776
He is going overboard.

00:59:45.676 --> 00:59:46.456
What happened, Reena?

00:59:46.706 --> 00:59:48.146
I am just doing my job.

00:59:48.376 --> 00:59:51.186
Even if I am not at fault,
all the blame falls on me.

00:59:53.916 --> 00:59:55.916
Maybe I should have studied better.

00:59:57.496 --> 01:00:00.326
No, Reena.
You are not at fault.

01:00:01.746 --> 01:00:03.546
As Arjun said

01:00:03.696 --> 01:00:05.736
the one who initiated this
case was Dr. Preetham.

01:00:06.966 --> 01:00:08.686
So, he should take responsibility.

01:00:10.126 --> 01:00:11.546
We can only say
that we didn't do it.

01:00:12.386 --> 01:00:15.136
Can we prove it every time?
Tell me.

01:00:16.596 --> 01:00:17.576
I don't know why.

01:00:18.766 --> 01:00:21.436
For a while, I've been feeling
like something is going wrong.

01:00:22.436 --> 01:00:23.916
But, I don't know what it is.

01:00:27.856 --> 01:00:31.266
Actually, I feel the same way.

01:00:32.626 --> 01:00:35.746
I've been feeling
disturbed for a while.

01:00:36.906 --> 01:00:38.106
I don't know what it is.

01:00:39.446 --> 01:00:40.686
But, I know why.

01:00:41.076 --> 01:00:41.976
Why?

01:00:45.356 --> 01:00:46.716
You shouldn't get
angry if I tell you.

01:00:46.876 --> 01:00:47.736
No, tell me.

01:00:51.336 --> 01:00:52.226
Dr. Radhi.

01:00:53.346 --> 01:00:58.416
If she was here, she would have
chosen the procedures correctly.

01:00:59.976 --> 01:01:02.536
In case,
even if there was any mistake

01:01:03.146 --> 01:01:05.146
she would have taken responsibility.

01:01:07.686 --> 01:01:09.776
We wouldn't have been
involved in any of this.

01:01:10.856 --> 01:01:12.636
Moreover, as long as she was here

01:01:12.816 --> 01:01:14.556
the staff, nurses

01:01:14.776 --> 01:01:16.836
and even the doctors

01:01:17.416 --> 01:01:19.566
didn't face any pressure
from the management side.

01:01:20.616 --> 01:01:21.466
Think about it.

01:01:22.576 --> 01:01:24.076
Everything was going smoothly.

01:01:24.836 --> 01:01:25.896
Life was good.

01:01:32.836 --> 01:01:33.636
Reena.

01:01:34.426 --> 01:01:36.636
Reena, I didn't mean to
hurt you or to get angry.

01:01:37.056 --> 01:01:37.906
I meant it in general.

01:01:38.516 --> 01:01:40.296
There is nothing
to get angry about.

01:01:40.886 --> 01:01:42.006
As you said

01:01:42.556 --> 01:01:44.266
I can't fight with her authority.

01:01:46.566 --> 01:01:49.966
I don't have any problem
in working with her.

01:01:51.126 --> 01:01:55.076
But, I don't think that Dr. Radhi
treated others the same way.

01:02:21.716 --> 01:02:23.056
Anitha, Anitha.
Just a minute.

01:02:25.976 --> 01:02:27.476
What you said is right.

01:02:29.266 --> 01:02:31.726
I don't have any right
to talk about your past.

01:02:35.306 --> 01:02:37.526
Hey, I didn't mean it.

01:02:39.576 --> 01:02:41.546
I shouldn't have spoken like that.
Sorry.

01:02:45.616 --> 01:02:47.136
You are dominating me, Anitha.

01:02:47.366 --> 01:02:48.676
That too, regarding my job.

01:02:49.456 --> 01:02:52.906
You know
how important this job is to me.

01:02:53.326 --> 01:02:55.126
But, the way you spoke to me,

01:02:55.466 --> 01:02:57.886
the way you treated me..
I didn't like any of it.

01:02:58.046 --> 01:03:00.006
As far as I am concerned,
I am a good doctor.

01:03:00.076 --> 01:03:01.686
I am capable of solving cases.

01:03:03.296 --> 01:03:07.636
You could have told me
earlier that you feel this way.

01:03:08.266 --> 01:03:10.046
You could have
communicated like this.

01:03:10.486 --> 01:03:13.426
Anitha, even if I am
a fun and chill person

01:03:14.016 --> 01:03:15.866
I become serious when I am at work.

01:03:17.906 --> 01:03:18.946
That's why I got angry.

01:03:19.946 --> 01:03:20.766
Hey, sorry.

01:03:23.946 --> 01:03:25.116
Even I am sorry.

01:03:26.366 --> 01:03:28.576
I have also dominated you, right?

01:03:31.166 --> 01:03:31.986
Sorry.

01:03:36.046 --> 01:03:38.036
I am sorry.
Are you okay now?

01:03:40.116 --> 01:03:41.936
We have patched up, right?

01:03:42.366 --> 01:03:43.626
You're not angry anymore, right?

01:03:44.286 --> 01:03:45.366
You are okay, right?

01:03:48.076 --> 01:03:48.926
Okay.

01:03:49.346 --> 01:03:51.046
Let's meet at home.
- Okay.

01:03:52.476 --> 01:03:53.316
Bye.

01:04:56.528 --> 01:04:59.448
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

01:05:01.558 --> 01:05:04.198
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

01:05:06.648 --> 01:05:09.778
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

01:05:11.468 --> 01:05:13.728
♪ Our patience wins ♪

01:05:14.068 --> 01:05:16.378
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

01:05:16.698 --> 01:05:19.228
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

01:05:19.408 --> 01:05:21.968
♪ I am a doctor ♪

01:05:24.148 --> 01:05:26.898
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

01:05:29.138 --> 01:05:31.898
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

01:05:33.778 --> 01:05:37.958
♪ In it, I'm a doctor ♪

01:05:52.308 --> 01:05:54.148
Aunt, the shop is nearby.

01:05:54.348 --> 01:05:55.948
Why did you bring me along?

01:05:56.088 --> 01:05:58.208
I don't know where I can
find the things you ask for.

01:05:58.238 --> 01:06:00.458
That's why I brought you here.
You can take it now.

01:06:01.988 --> 01:06:03.408
I just want the mushroom.

01:06:03.568 --> 01:06:04.488
I will go and see there.

01:06:28.118 --> 01:06:30.598
Reena, did you get the mushroom?

01:07:17.138 --> 01:07:18.848
Did you get
all the things you wanted?

01:07:19.108 --> 01:07:22.208
You shouldn't come to my
house and ask me for things.

01:07:23.068 --> 01:07:24.548
I got what I needed, Aunt.

01:07:29.128 --> 01:07:30.798
How are you, Radhi?

01:07:31.618 --> 01:07:32.598
I'm fine.

01:07:32.788 --> 01:07:35.038
How are Dev and the kids?

01:07:35.328 --> 01:07:36.188
They're fine.

01:07:37.708 --> 01:07:39.328
I heard that your father was here.

01:07:39.458 --> 01:07:42.048
Yes, he came to meet the kids.

01:07:43.378 --> 01:07:46.768
I couldn't talk to you
after what happened at home.

01:07:49.348 --> 01:07:50.658
Don't worry.

01:07:50.708 --> 01:07:52.128
Everything will be back to normal.

01:07:53.978 --> 01:07:57.798
They think that everything will
be back to normal only if I leave.

01:08:00.018 --> 01:08:01.728
Who asked you to leave?

01:08:02.898 --> 01:08:05.438
Did I disturb you
after you came back?

01:08:06.068 --> 01:08:07.578
I didn't even ask you
why you came back.

01:08:08.118 --> 01:08:09.558
I'll take care of my problems.

01:08:09.828 --> 01:08:11.858
I won't come to you for that.

01:08:12.138 --> 01:08:12.968
Is that enough?

01:08:15.988 --> 01:08:16.828
Radhi..

01:08:22.918 --> 01:08:23.888
What is this, dear?

01:08:29.508 --> 01:08:30.428
Doctor.

01:08:31.348 --> 01:08:32.388
Come in.

01:08:36.768 --> 01:08:37.658
Sit down.

01:08:41.768 --> 01:08:43.418
So, what's your name?

01:08:44.238 --> 01:08:45.758
Tell her your name.

01:08:46.248 --> 01:08:47.088
Vishwa.

01:08:48.488 --> 01:08:49.308
Vishwa.

01:08:52.028 --> 01:08:54.048
Will you tell me your name
only after asking your mother?

01:08:56.408 --> 01:08:58.458
Anyway.
What's troubling you?

01:08:58.828 --> 01:09:00.918
He has some boils
all over his body, Doctor.

01:09:01.188 --> 01:09:02.208
Show her your hand, Vishwa.

01:09:04.548 --> 01:09:05.368
Okay..

01:09:08.298 --> 01:09:10.298
This is an allergy.

01:09:11.638 --> 01:09:12.538
Does it hurt?

01:09:13.348 --> 01:09:17.208
He says that it hurts when I press
on the dark spots.

01:09:19.728 --> 01:09:20.678
Okay.

01:09:21.648 --> 01:09:22.788
What did he eat last time?

01:09:23.228 --> 01:09:24.748
Normal home food.

01:09:25.238 --> 01:09:26.658
Brinjal curry.

01:09:28.148 --> 01:09:29.008
Brinjal.

01:09:29.988 --> 01:09:31.568
Many people are allergic to brinjal.

01:09:31.778 --> 01:09:33.148
Your son is also allergic to it.

01:09:33.368 --> 01:09:34.748
Don't give him brinjal anymore.

01:09:35.828 --> 01:09:37.768
I'll prescribe
some pills and ointments.

01:09:39.498 --> 01:09:41.118
Ask him to use them for two days.

01:09:42.918 --> 01:09:44.248
He'll be fine
if he rests for two days.

01:09:44.418 --> 01:09:45.198
Okay, Doctor.

01:09:45.508 --> 01:09:47.518
Have fun, you don't have
to go to school for two days.

01:09:47.838 --> 01:09:49.318
It's not like that, Doctor.

01:09:49.368 --> 01:09:51.158
He likes to go to school
more than staying home.

01:09:51.408 --> 01:09:53.988
Why? Does he study a lot?

01:09:54.148 --> 01:09:55.108
Yes, Doctor.

01:09:55.308 --> 01:09:58.118
Everyone in school teases him
by calling him a nerd.

01:10:04.548 --> 01:10:05.368
Okay.

01:10:05.688 --> 01:10:07.668
Don't give him brinjal again.
- Okay, Doctor.

01:10:08.028 --> 01:10:10.108
Give this prescription
to the nurse outside.

01:10:10.188 --> 01:10:11.618
She'll give him
an injection and the pills.

01:10:11.848 --> 01:10:13.368
Thank you, Doctor.
Come on.

01:10:16.538 --> 01:10:17.338
Hey, nerd.

01:10:19.368 --> 01:10:20.658
Don't cry
while getting the injection.

01:10:21.918 --> 01:10:23.638
Okay, Doctor.
- Bye.

01:10:59.878 --> 01:11:00.768
Teju..

01:11:02.138 --> 01:11:02.948
Hello.

01:11:31.738 --> 01:11:32.978
What is it, Teju? You called?

01:11:34.978 --> 01:11:35.858
I didn't call you.

01:11:35.988 --> 01:11:37.888
It was in my pocket,
so must have been a butt-dial.

01:11:38.238 --> 01:11:39.088
Oh.

01:11:40.238 --> 01:11:43.028
Is that why you hung up
after I said hello?

01:11:46.128 --> 01:11:49.108
Anyway, I thought you
wanted to tell me something.

01:11:52.088 --> 01:11:53.988
I don't have anything to tell you.

01:11:56.718 --> 01:11:57.558
Hello..

01:12:11.028 --> 01:12:11.928
By the way

01:12:12.058 --> 01:12:13.668
your duty is with
the cinema doctor, right?

01:12:14.028 --> 01:12:14.928
What are you doing here?

01:12:15.698 --> 01:12:16.718
There's a new case.

01:12:17.028 --> 01:12:19.768
They asked for someone to assist
along with Reena.

01:12:19.818 --> 01:12:20.788
That's why I joined.

01:12:21.198 --> 01:12:22.028
Oh.

01:12:22.368 --> 01:12:23.508
Bad selection.

01:12:24.838 --> 01:12:28.178
Bro, I know details
about this case than you do.

01:12:28.658 --> 01:12:30.418
Is that so? What is it?
- Yes.

01:12:31.118 --> 01:12:32.268
What are you doing here?

01:12:32.628 --> 01:12:34.388
I asked you to analyse the patient.
Did you do it?

01:12:34.438 --> 01:12:35.748
Yes, I checked everything, Reena.

01:12:35.798 --> 01:12:37.328
Everything is normal.
We are good to go.

01:12:37.588 --> 01:12:39.588
Also, I explained everything
to the patient in detail, Reena.

01:12:40.008 --> 01:12:40.878
Okay, come.

01:12:42.138 --> 01:12:43.318
Don't worry about anything.

01:12:43.378 --> 01:12:44.558
Everything is going to be alright.

01:12:44.808 --> 01:12:46.568
Everything is going to happen
as we planned.

01:12:46.698 --> 01:12:47.568
Sit comfortably.

01:12:47.798 --> 01:12:49.468
Hi, sir. How are you?
- Hello, madam.

01:12:49.538 --> 01:12:50.658
I'm fine, ma'am.
- All okay?

01:12:50.728 --> 01:12:51.648
Okay, Doctor.

01:12:52.258 --> 01:12:54.928
Ma'am, they had
already given the IV.

01:12:55.028 --> 01:12:56.608
They said they would come back.
But no one came.

01:12:56.698 --> 01:12:59.628
Sir, what do you mean?
I just gave the IV.

01:12:59.938 --> 01:13:02.098
No, ma'am. It's been a while.
- Sorry.

01:13:02.478 --> 01:13:04.658
Sir, I'm sorry for making you wait.

01:13:05.908 --> 01:13:07.368
The vitals are normal.

01:13:07.498 --> 01:13:09.138
Your two children are also normal.

01:13:09.718 --> 01:13:11.618
Okay.
- Also, sir, an important thing.

01:13:11.788 --> 01:13:13.208
Your wife is perfectly fine.

01:13:14.178 --> 01:13:15.038
Thank God.

01:13:15.578 --> 01:13:16.458
I told you, right?

01:13:17.008 --> 01:13:17.908
Also, sir.

01:13:17.958 --> 01:13:20.638
Let's start the operation
this evening as we planned.

01:13:21.188 --> 01:13:21.998
Okay.

01:13:22.178 --> 01:13:24.598
You start the procedures
that you have to do.

01:13:24.848 --> 01:13:27.178
They will tell you what to do next
if you go to the reception.

01:13:27.768 --> 01:13:29.238
Okay, ma'am.
- Take care.

01:13:29.648 --> 01:13:32.658
Bye.
- Thank you. Thank you, ma'am.

01:13:36.278 --> 01:13:37.208
Hi, Aruna.

01:13:37.608 --> 01:13:38.778
Hi, ma'am.
- How are you?

01:13:39.338 --> 01:13:40.988
I'm fine, ma'am.
How are you?

01:13:41.038 --> 01:13:43.028
I'm fine.
- Ma'am, what happened to your hand?

01:13:43.828 --> 01:13:47.428
I cut my hand by mistake
when I'm chopping the vegetables.

01:13:47.618 --> 01:13:49.038
You could have been more careful.

01:13:49.208 --> 01:13:50.098
What's with the sudden visit?

01:13:50.998 --> 01:13:53.278
Ma'am, I'm getting married.

01:13:53.818 --> 01:13:55.938
You should definitely
come with your family.

01:13:56.098 --> 01:13:57.238
Congratulations, Aruna.

01:13:57.338 --> 01:13:58.888
I'll definitely come.

01:13:58.938 --> 01:13:59.838
Thank you, ma'am.

01:14:00.158 --> 01:14:02.888
I'm so happy for you, Aruna.

01:14:03.098 --> 01:14:04.018
I know, ma'am.

01:14:04.218 --> 01:14:07.348
Oh, I almost forgot.
What do you want to eat?

01:14:07.428 --> 01:14:10.018
Tea, coffee, juice, snacks?
- I don't want anything, ma'am.

01:14:10.058 --> 01:14:12.698
No, no, no. You have to drink
my coffee. I'll get you a coffee.

01:14:13.018 --> 01:14:13.938
Okay, ma'am.

01:14:27.338 --> 01:14:28.218
What is it, Aruna?

01:14:28.578 --> 01:14:30.238
Are you going to assist me here?

01:14:31.788 --> 01:14:33.318
How is the wedding
preparation going?

01:14:33.668 --> 01:14:36.748
My brother is taking
care of all the work.

01:14:36.998 --> 01:14:39.828
I got busy with
the hospital work, ma'am.

01:14:44.098 --> 01:14:45.048
Thank you, ma'am.

01:14:52.348 --> 01:14:54.608
It's not like before, ma'am.

01:14:54.958 --> 01:14:59.428
The new chief doctor is asking
all the nurses to work overtime.

01:15:00.068 --> 01:15:01.678
He's asking them to continue

01:15:01.718 --> 01:15:03.348
another shift as soon
as they're done with one.

01:15:04.568 --> 01:15:07.078
They have to assist
the surgeries in between.

01:15:07.788 --> 01:15:10.218
This is just a problem
for the nurses, ma'am.

01:15:11.078 --> 01:15:14.558
That's why I called
you the other day.

01:15:21.008 --> 01:15:24.008
It's not that I don't understand
your situation, ma'am.

01:15:25.008 --> 01:15:27.008
But I felt that it would be better

01:15:27.058 --> 01:15:31.338
if you were in the hospital
in this crucial situation.

01:15:32.388 --> 01:15:35.858
Everyone in the hospital
wants you to come, ma'am.

01:15:36.018 --> 01:15:38.878
It's been more than a month
since you resigned.

01:15:39.528 --> 01:15:43.968
But everyone feels
that it would've been better

01:15:44.028 --> 01:15:46.368
had you been running the hospital.

01:15:46.948 --> 01:15:48.988
I joined you as a trainee

01:15:49.488 --> 01:15:53.638
and now I'm a head nurse.

01:15:53.708 --> 01:15:55.668
That's not because
of my work alone.

01:15:56.078 --> 01:15:58.908
It's because of your training
and lead, ma'am.

01:15:59.208 --> 01:16:03.578
You have trained
so many doctors and nurses.

01:16:04.628 --> 01:16:08.488
People outside may think
that you are a good doctor.

01:16:08.848 --> 01:16:10.548
But we know that you have trained

01:16:10.598 --> 01:16:14.648
and guided so many
successful doctors and nurses.

01:16:15.188 --> 01:16:18.638
Not only that,
we know that you managed

01:16:19.268 --> 01:16:23.368
to run such a big hospital
so successfully.

01:16:23.958 --> 01:16:27.158
Recently, there was
a delivery case, ma'am.

01:16:27.358 --> 01:16:29.088
The chief doctor attended it.

01:16:29.168 --> 01:16:32.598
I would have been very
happy if you were there, ma'am.

01:16:34.118 --> 01:16:35.068
I understand, Aruna.

01:16:35.918 --> 01:16:37.498
But I can't do anything now.

01:16:38.168 --> 01:16:39.748
I won't come back to the hospital.

01:16:40.238 --> 01:16:41.598
It's not going to happen.

01:16:41.788 --> 01:16:43.778
I really need this break now.

01:16:44.408 --> 01:16:47.168
I'm prioritising my family
over the hospital now.

01:16:47.648 --> 01:16:49.458
There is no change in my decision.

01:16:54.798 --> 01:16:56.128
Have your coffee.

01:17:17.118 --> 01:17:18.018
What happened?

01:17:19.168 --> 01:17:20.738
Why are you so upset?

01:17:22.418 --> 01:17:24.478
Arjun has paid off all our loans.

01:17:26.188 --> 01:17:29.798
But I don't know
what to do for my survival.

01:17:32.348 --> 01:17:33.958
They have shut down the company.

01:17:36.138 --> 01:17:39.698
I don't have money to start
a new business or invest.

01:17:41.268 --> 01:17:44.128
I don't know
what to do or where to go.

01:17:45.388 --> 01:17:50.388
You are still one of the board
members of RK Hospital, right?

01:17:51.068 --> 01:17:53.398
Why don't you go there
and start working again?

01:17:53.488 --> 01:17:55.068
I am not a board member anymore.

01:17:55.818 --> 01:18:00.428
I had to sell all my shares
because of this loan issue.

01:18:01.498 --> 01:18:02.778
I am completely dry.

01:18:03.038 --> 01:18:08.868
And also, I have brought many
problems to Arjun and the hospital.

01:18:09.158 --> 01:18:12.388
Arjun was kind enough
to pay off my loans.

01:18:13.098 --> 01:18:16.188
How can I go back to him
and ask him to let me work there?

01:18:18.318 --> 01:18:22.288
I don't know how you were before.

01:18:22.738 --> 01:18:29.488
But from now on, you have
to be sincere in your work.

01:18:30.608 --> 01:18:32.228
I think you should start fresh.

01:18:33.028 --> 01:18:34.008
You can do it.

01:18:34.698 --> 01:18:36.728
Plus, we don't have
any other option.

01:18:40.598 --> 01:18:46.038
If you call Arjun,
I think he will help you.

01:18:48.078 --> 01:18:50.068
Why don't you think about it?

01:19:21.998 --> 01:19:23.278
Why is he calling me now?

01:19:25.378 --> 01:19:26.378
Tell me, Madan.

01:19:26.998 --> 01:19:31.478
Naveen, don't get angry
and just listen to me patiently.

01:19:34.128 --> 01:19:37.788
I want to come back to RK Hospital.

01:19:39.058 --> 01:19:41.988
I want to ask Arjun for help.

01:19:43.438 --> 01:19:44.898
Oh God!

01:19:45.268 --> 01:19:47.688
Haven't you done enough already?

01:19:48.258 --> 01:19:49.548
You want to come back?

01:19:51.898 --> 01:19:54.678
Madan, I don't want you
to come back to the hospital.

01:19:55.778 --> 01:19:56.878
Such a rubbish idea.

01:19:57.408 --> 01:19:58.448
What do you want now?

01:19:59.128 --> 01:20:00.878
You want a job, right?

01:20:01.328 --> 01:20:03.288
I'll try my best to get you a job.

01:20:03.448 --> 01:20:05.968
But please don't think
about coming back here.

01:20:06.918 --> 01:20:08.508
I don't have any other option.

01:20:08.918 --> 01:20:11.628
Madan, I can't work
under the pressure

01:20:11.678 --> 01:20:13.468
of revealing
my relationship with you.

01:20:14.148 --> 01:20:15.028
Do you understand?

01:20:15.628 --> 01:20:16.978
Stop thinking like this.

01:20:17.548 --> 01:20:18.378
Hang up the phone.

01:20:19.428 --> 01:20:20.598
Hey, Naveen..

01:20:32.388 --> 01:20:33.468
Is everything ready?

01:20:33.578 --> 01:20:35.428
Yes, all set.
- Get the betadine.

01:20:41.198 --> 01:20:42.028
Hi, everyone.

01:20:42.118 --> 01:20:43.368
Hi, sir.
- All ready, guys?

01:20:43.488 --> 01:20:44.918
Just relax.
- Yes, sir.

01:20:45.248 --> 01:20:46.808
First time?
- Yes, sir.

01:20:47.418 --> 01:20:48.438
Enjoy yourselves.

01:20:48.488 --> 01:20:51.168
Let me first explain
the whole process, right?

01:20:51.788 --> 01:20:55.218
I am going to take the scalpel
and start going layer by layer.

01:20:56.128 --> 01:20:58.858
After we go deep enough

01:20:59.098 --> 01:21:01.208
pull the first baby out slowly

01:21:01.328 --> 01:21:05.018
without injuring it,
as soft as possible.

01:21:05.268 --> 01:21:06.618
Take your time, alright?
- Sure, sir.

01:21:07.348 --> 01:21:10.358
After that, you both give it time.

01:21:10.688 --> 01:21:13.118
Push the second baby slowly.

01:21:13.508 --> 01:21:16.008
Then she will help you
bring out the second baby safely.

01:21:16.198 --> 01:21:17.148
Alright?
- Okay, sir.

01:21:17.198 --> 01:21:21.018
But that's going to happen after
we reach the amniotic sac layer.

01:21:21.528 --> 01:21:24.238
We can start this process only after
cutting the amniotic sac layer.

01:21:24.468 --> 01:21:26.608
Sure, sir. - You would have
seen it in the simulation, right?

01:21:27.008 --> 01:21:28.388
Same way. All set?

01:21:28.538 --> 01:21:29.718
Yes, sir.
- Okay, sir.

01:21:31.098 --> 01:21:33.028
We are going to start the surgery.

01:21:33.168 --> 01:21:34.728
Have fun and relax.

01:21:34.878 --> 01:21:36.188
We will be done in a jiffy.

01:22:13.128 --> 01:22:15.088
Sir, her heartbeat is racing.

01:22:18.178 --> 01:22:20.418
Amritha, just chill.

01:22:20.468 --> 01:22:21.438
Be relaxed.

01:22:22.388 --> 01:22:24.038
The twins are about to come out.

01:22:24.838 --> 01:22:26.198
It's a very special thing.

01:22:26.388 --> 01:22:29.378
As long as you are happy,
the baby will be born happily.

01:22:31.728 --> 01:22:33.268
So, shall we start?

01:22:50.368 --> 01:22:51.598
Reena, are you ready?
- Yes, sir.

01:22:52.168 --> 01:22:53.058
Can you try now?

01:22:53.128 --> 01:22:54.048
Yeah, we can do it, sir.

01:22:54.148 --> 01:22:56.118
Slowly. Now try.
- Sure, sir.

01:22:59.268 --> 01:23:00.088
Oh, wow!

01:23:01.408 --> 01:23:02.488
Conjoined twins.

01:23:09.428 --> 01:23:10.628
We have to be very careful.

01:23:56.298 --> 01:23:57.658
Oh, my God! Move! Move!

01:24:05.688 --> 01:24:07.328
First of all,
Kiran, Reena and Nilofer.

01:24:08.028 --> 01:24:09.668
Congratulations. Very well done.

01:24:09.968 --> 01:24:10.788
Thank you, sir.

01:24:11.948 --> 01:24:12.828
But there is a problem.

01:24:13.488 --> 01:24:15.388
Both babies have complications.

01:24:15.728 --> 01:24:17.228
One of the babies
has kidney failure.

01:24:17.498 --> 01:24:19.818
The other baby doesn't have
a functioning heart.

01:24:20.298 --> 01:24:21.378
It's okay for now.

01:24:21.428 --> 01:24:22.848
But they can't manage it.

01:24:23.968 --> 01:24:25.808
One baby will start depending
on the other baby's heart.

01:24:25.968 --> 01:24:28.618
And that baby will start depending
on this baby's kidney.

01:24:28.808 --> 01:24:29.968
This will become fatal.

01:24:30.388 --> 01:24:32.408
We won't be able to save
both the babies.

01:24:34.138 --> 01:24:36.548
Sir, I have an alternative.

01:24:38.358 --> 01:24:40.028
We can save one baby.

01:24:40.988 --> 01:24:43.218
But we have to do
a transplant, sir.

01:24:44.568 --> 01:24:47.878
Because the failure rate is higher
for the baby with a kidney problem.

01:24:48.768 --> 01:24:53.038
So, if we transfer it from
the baby with the good heart

01:24:53.268 --> 01:24:54.928
we can save one baby, sir.

01:25:01.088 --> 01:25:01.948
Okay..

01:25:02.508 --> 01:25:06.778
Then, Reena, explain this
to Amritha's husband in detail.

01:25:07.338 --> 01:25:11.058
We can't proceed without his
consent. You know that, right?

01:25:12.178 --> 01:25:14.178
Yes, sir.
- You try and talk to him.

01:25:14.578 --> 01:25:16.038
Yeah, sure, sir.

01:25:16.838 --> 01:25:17.938
We'll try our best.

01:25:18.688 --> 01:25:19.518
Yes, sir.

01:25:26.958 --> 01:25:27.898
Sir.

01:25:28.648 --> 01:25:30.908
Doctor, how did the surgery go?

01:25:31.218 --> 01:25:33.418
My wife and the babies
are fine, right?

01:25:33.678 --> 01:25:34.598
Sir, sir.

01:25:34.908 --> 01:25:36.708
The surgery went well, sir.

01:25:37.578 --> 01:25:38.918
Your wife is fine.

01:25:39.788 --> 01:25:43.788
But both the babies
have a complication, sir.

01:25:45.918 --> 01:25:47.528
What are you saying, madam?
Complications?

01:25:48.428 --> 01:25:51.568
We can fix that, right?
You can fix it, right?

01:25:52.138 --> 01:25:55.808
One of your babies
doesn't have a functioning heart.

01:25:55.978 --> 01:25:57.418
All the other organs are fine.

01:25:58.638 --> 01:26:01.328
The other baby's
other organs are fine.

01:26:01.718 --> 01:26:03.378
But kidney failure.

01:26:06.568 --> 01:26:11.568
It's not good for both the babies
to depend on each other, sir.

01:26:12.118 --> 01:26:14.358
It's dangerous
for both the babies, sir.

01:26:15.578 --> 01:26:20.138
So, the chief doctors
have taken a decision.

01:26:21.328 --> 01:26:25.508
The kid with kidney failure
can't survive for long, sir.

01:26:26.188 --> 01:26:28.788
So, if we do a heart transplant

01:26:29.028 --> 01:26:32.348
to the baby who doesn't
have a functioning heart,

01:26:33.258 --> 01:26:36.308
we can save at least one baby, sir.

01:26:36.638 --> 01:26:37.558
Sorry, sir.

01:26:38.228 --> 01:26:39.158
Oh, no.

01:26:39.888 --> 01:26:43.198
Ma'am, there are so many
medical advancements now.

01:26:43.568 --> 01:26:46.168
They're doing some operations.
We're hearing so many things.

01:26:46.728 --> 01:26:49.528
Can we get an opinion
from another surgeon, ma'am?

01:26:49.568 --> 01:26:50.438
Please, ma'am.

01:26:50.738 --> 01:26:51.738
No, sir.

01:26:51.948 --> 01:26:53.508
We've tried, sir.

01:26:55.368 --> 01:26:58.868
I understand it will take time
for you to process this.

01:26:59.278 --> 01:27:03.068
But we can't do anything
without your consent, sir.

01:27:03.668 --> 01:27:06.428
We can save at least one baby.

01:27:11.428 --> 01:27:14.008
I don't have the courage
to lose both the babies, ma'am.

01:27:16.098 --> 01:27:20.488
But when I think of losing one kid

01:27:21.348 --> 01:27:22.678
my heart aches, ma'am.

01:27:30.738 --> 01:27:32.658
We don't have
any other option, sir.

01:27:37.078 --> 01:27:37.968
I understand.

01:27:42.138 --> 01:27:43.998
I want at least one baby, ma'am.

01:27:47.298 --> 01:27:49.078
Please get ready for the procedure.

01:27:50.588 --> 01:27:51.548
Thank you.

01:28:06.448 --> 01:28:07.438
Yeah, Reena.

01:28:07.578 --> 01:28:09.608
We're just discussing
the procedures and the plans.

01:28:10.918 --> 01:28:13.018
The patient's husband
has agreed for the surgery, sir.

01:28:13.738 --> 01:28:14.818
Sir, with all due respect,

01:28:15.118 --> 01:28:18.508
if we want to save
at least one baby as Reena said

01:28:18.738 --> 01:28:19.978
we have to do this, sir.

01:28:20.368 --> 01:28:23.918
Sir, we're under-equipped
to perform this.

01:28:24.288 --> 01:28:28.168
There are no specific doctors
in this department.

01:28:28.298 --> 01:28:29.928
So what? We can outsource.

01:28:30.918 --> 01:28:32.518
I'll get the doctors myself.

01:28:32.758 --> 01:28:35.358
Sir, but we don't have time.

01:28:36.048 --> 01:28:38.218
I think we should think
of other options.

01:28:38.318 --> 01:28:39.458
I understand what you mean.

01:28:39.828 --> 01:28:41.778
I have a lot of previous interns.

01:28:42.638 --> 01:28:43.638
I'll get someone.

01:28:56.198 --> 01:28:57.858
Hello, David, can you hear me?
Hello?

01:28:58.218 --> 01:28:59.178
Darn!

01:29:06.538 --> 01:29:09.608
Sir, is none of your
assistants available?

01:29:14.038 --> 01:29:16.048
We need an experienced
surgeon like you

01:29:16.568 --> 01:29:18.928
in order to perform such
a high-level transplant.

01:29:19.178 --> 01:29:21.748
Where do I look for someone
in a situation like this?

01:29:22.058 --> 01:29:24.588
Moreover, in this short time period,

01:29:24.848 --> 01:29:27.358
where can we find
seniors and experts?

01:29:30.728 --> 01:29:31.578
Arjun.

01:29:32.728 --> 01:29:34.588
Why don't you try in your circles?

01:29:35.038 --> 01:29:38.918
With your business connect, if
you can contact some hospital CEOs.

01:29:39.568 --> 01:29:40.888
If you personally request,

01:29:40.948 --> 01:29:42.488
maybe some doctors may come.

01:29:42.538 --> 01:29:43.358
Try it.

01:29:44.038 --> 01:29:44.858
Sure, sir.

01:29:46.458 --> 01:29:47.368
Sir..

01:29:49.388 --> 01:29:50.268
I know someone.

01:29:52.678 --> 01:29:54.398
They'll be a perfect match
for this case.

01:29:55.458 --> 01:29:56.358
Who?

01:29:58.178 --> 01:29:59.178
Dr. Radhi.

01:30:09.398 --> 01:30:11.238
'Arjun, did you get
the surgeon contract?'

01:30:11.298 --> 01:30:13.328
'That's what I'm looking for.
I'll arrange it soon.'

01:30:13.778 --> 01:30:14.908
'We don't have time, Arjun.'

01:30:15.108 --> 01:30:17.258
'The heart donor baby
has pneumonia.'

01:30:17.608 --> 01:30:19.808
'The lungs are fully inflamed.
We must do something, Arjun.'

01:30:19.988 --> 01:30:21.368
'Don't waste your time, Arjun.'

01:30:21.778 --> 01:30:23.358
'I'll never come back.'

01:30:23.898 --> 01:30:26.328
'Go and arrange some other doctor.'

